{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dakx9KsVQWgBqg6wJk9PSg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Cross-benchmark gradient是primary finding且远比第一版dream更陡峭： MMLU(56%)\n2\t  > ARC(42%) > HellaSwag(34%) > GSM8K(25%)，spread 31pp。 reasoning tasks的CoT stochasticity将massive方差从item_id转移到seed×item和temp×item（各15-25%），\n3\t  这解释了为什么prior single-benchmark studies得出看似矛盾的结论。\n4\t\n5\t  核心升级：\"optimal evaluation protocol reverses across task types\"—— MMLU是item-limited（需420\n6\t  items for G≥0.90），GSM8K是seed-limited（需10+ seeds for G≥0.90）。 \"Universal reproducibility\n7\t  recipe is illusory\"被数据完全支持，且比预期更强。\n8\t\n9\t  Model-as-facet分析cleanly提取model×item（~10%），item_id降至49%但仍为最大单一组分。 Bootstrap CIs tight（4-6pp宽度）且benchmark间不重叠——gradient具有full\n10\t  statistical significance。 Separability是clean confirmatory null（hardware×methodology\n11\t  <0.3%）。\n12\t\n13\t  三条claim全部成立无需弱化。AAAI \"evaluation methodology\" track投稿正常推进。 Lead figure: 4-benchmark\n14\t  stacked bars展示variance structure的系统性迁移， signature visual直接支撑\"no universal recipe\"叙事。\n15\t\n16\t  '\n17\timagined_experiments:\n18\t- name: Full-scale MMLU precision study with confound fix\n19\t  plan_id: exp-001\n20\t  description: '4 models (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B-IT, Mistral-7B-v0.3)\n21\t    × 3 precisions (FP32/BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings\n22\t    × 200 MMLU items (stratified), 全部使用vLLM V0 enforce_eager消除engine confound。 总条件数\n23\t    4×3×6×6×3×4 = 5,184 per item，总记录 5,184×200 = 1,036,800。\n24\t\n25\t    '\n26\t  expected_results:\n27\t    total_records: 1036800\n28\t    conditions_per_model: 1296\n29\t    overall_accuracy: 0.667\n30\t    accuracy_fp32: 0.664\n31\t    accuracy_bf16: 0.669\n32\t    accuracy_fp16: 0.667\n33\t    accuracy_spread_across_precisions_pp: 0.5\n34\t    item_id: 0.56\n35\t    residual: 0.207\n36\t    prompt_template_x_item_id: 0.062\n37\t    temperature_x_item_id: 0.059\n38\t    seed_x_item_id: 0.03\n39\t    precision_x_item_id: 0.018\n40\t    ordering_x_item_id: 0.015\n41\t    prompt_template: 0.018\n42\t    temperature: 0.014\n43\t    ordering: 0.008\n44\t    precision: 0.003\n45\t    seed: 0.002\n46\t    direct_infra_x_method_total: 0.004\n47\t    models_with_item_id_rank1: 4\n48\t    item_id_range_across_models:\n49\t    - 0.516\n50\t    - 0.602\n51\t    qwen3_8b_item_id: 0.578\n52\t    llama31_8b_item_id: 0.554\n53\t    gemma2_9b_item_id: 0.602\n54\t    mistral_7b_item_id: 0.516\n55\t    precision_main_before_fix_mvp: 0.0087\n56\t    precision_main_after_fix: 0.003\n57\t    precision_x_item_before_fix_mvp: 0.0724\n58\t    precision_x_item_after_fix: 0.018\n59\t    fp32_bf16_gap_before_fix_pp: 8.5\n60\t    fp32_bf16_gap_after_fix_pp: 0.5\n61\t    g_coefficient_correct: 0.36\n62\t    g_text_exact_match: 0.94\n63\t    text_match_prompt_x_item: 0.362\n64\t    text_match_item_id: 0.218\n65\t    text_match_precision_x_temperature: 0.014\n66\t  result_rationale: 'MVP的precision主效应(0.87%)和precision×item(7.24%)源于float32使用不同vLLM\n67\t    engine路径（V1 CUDA graph vs V0 eager）， 导致FP32准确率系统性偏低5.7pp。统一V0 enforce_eager后三种精度走同一compute\n68\t    path， FP32/BF16/FP16准确率差收敛至0.5pp内（纯numerical noise水平，符合IEEE 754 rounding差异预期）。\n69\t\n70\t    Precision释放的~6%方差重新分配：precision×item从7.2%→1.8%（剩余为genuine numerical sensitivity\n71\t    on boundary items）， precision主效应从0.87%→0.3%，释放的份额主要回流到residual（+3.1pp）和小量到item_id（+0.2pp），\n72\t    因为之前被precision confound扭曲的item-level patterns现在归入正确组分。\n73\t\n74\t    4个模型均以item_id为rank-1（51.6%-60.2%），因为MMLU的item difficulty分布（从trivial factual recall到\n75\t    expert-level reasoning）在所有7-9B instruction-tuned模型上产生类似的accuracy ceiling/floor效应。\n76\t    Gemma-2最高(60.2%)因其instruction-tuning使easy items更稳定（floor更高）， Mistral最低(51.6%)因其在部分domain上accuracy分布更平坦（difficulty\n77\t    gradient被压缩）。\n78\t\n79\t    200 items分层采样比MVP的50 items提供更稳定的方差估计，SE减半，CI收窄~50%。\n80\t\n81\t    Text-exact-match指标复现MVP pattern：prompt×item主导(36.2%)而非item_id(21.8%)， 因为不同prompt\n82\t    template导致model生成不同格式的答案字符串（\"A\"/\"(A)\"/\"The answer is A\"）， 这种格式变异是item-specific的（有些items的答案format更鲁棒）。\n83\t    precision×temperature在text-match下仍检出1.4%（CI不含零），确认floating-point non-associativity效应。\n84\t\n85\t    '\n86\t  tables:\n87\t  - name: 'Table 1: Variance Components — MMLU 200 items, 4 models pooled (binary_correct)'\n88\t    columns:\n89\t    - Component\n90\t    - '% Variance'\n91\t    - SE\n92\t    - 95% CI Lower\n93\t    - 95% CI Upper\n94\t    - MVP (50 items)\n95\t    rows:\n96\t    - - item_id\n97\t      - 56.0\n98\t      - 1.8\n99\t      - 52.5\n100\t      - 59.5\n101\t      - '58.4'\n102\t    - - residual\n103\t      - 20.7\n104\t      - 0.8\n105\t      - 19.1\n106\t      - 22.3\n107\t      - '17.6'\n108\t    - - prompt×item\n109\t      - 6.2\n110\t      - 0.6\n111\t      - 5.0\n112\t      - 7.4\n113\t      - '5.7'\n114\t    - - temp×item\n115\t      - 5.9\n116\t      - 0.5\n117\t      - 4.9\n118\t      - 6.9\n119\t      - '6.9'\n120\t    - - seed×item\n121\t      - 3.0\n122\t      - 0.3\n123\t      - 2.4\n124\t      - 3.6\n125\t      - '2.7'\n126\t    - - precision×item\n127\t      - 1.8\n128\t      - 0.2\n129\t      - 1.4\n130\t      - 2.2\n131\t      - 7.2*\n132\t    - - ordering×item\n133\t      - 1.5\n134\t      - 0.2\n135\t      - 1.1\n136\t      - 1.9\n137\t      - —\n138\t    - - prompt\n139\t      - 1.8\n140\t      - 0.3\n141\t      - 1.2\n142\t      - 2.4\n143\t      - —\n144\t    - - temperature\n145\t      - 1.4\n146\t      - 0.2\n147\t      - 1.0\n148\t      - 1.8\n149\t      - —\n150\t    - - ordering\n151\t      - 0.8\n152\t      - 0.2\n153\t      - 0.4\n154\t      - 1.2\n155\t      - —\n156\t    - - precision\n157\t      - 0.3\n158\t      - 0.1\n159\t      - 0.1\n160\t      - 0.5\n161\t      - 0.87*\n162\t    - - seed\n163\t      - 0.2\n164\t      - 0.05\n165\t      - 0.1\n166\t      - 0.3\n167\t      - —\n168\t    - - infra×method (all)\n169\t      - 0.4\n170\t      - 0.1\n171\t      - 0.2\n172\t      - 0.6\n173\t      - <0.02\n174\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Model item_id Variance Share (MMLU)'\n175\t    columns:\n176\t    - Model\n177\t    - item_id %\n178\t    - Next Largest\n179\t    - Next %\n180\t    - Accuracy\n181\t    rows:\n182\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n183\t      - 60.2\n184\t      - residual\n185\t      - 17.1\n186\t      - 0.691\n187\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n188\t      - 57.8\n189\t      - residual\n190\t      - 18.3\n191\t      - 0.672\n192\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n193\t      - 55.4\n194\t      - residual\n195\t      - 19.8\n196\t      - 0.658\n197\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n198\t      - 51.6\n199\t      - residual\n200\t      - 22.4\n201\t      - 0.641\n202\t  figures_description:\n203\t  - 'Fig 1: Side-by-side stacked-bar — MVP (confounded, left) vs exp-001 (fixed, right)。\n204\t    precision和precision×item色块在右侧坍缩，item_id占比稳定，直观展示confound fix的效果。'\n205\t  - 'Fig 2: 4-panel per-model stacked bars，each panel one model。item_id色块在所有panel中均为最大，\n206\t    展示cross-model consistency。Mistral panel中residual略大，Gemma panel中item_id略大。'\n207\t  - 'Fig 3: Per-item accuracy scatter (FP32 vs BF16)。MVP中slope偏离1.0且intercept偏移（confound），\n208\t    exp-001中points紧贴diagonal（r>0.998），outlier items标注。'\n209\t  analysis: '核心发现：engine confound fix后item dominance完全稳健（56.0% vs MVP 58.4%，差异在SE范围内），\n210\t    precision主效应从0.87%坍缩至0.3%。这同时验证了Claim 1和提供了方法论贡献 （vLLM engine配置对variance attribution的系统性影响）。\n211\t    4个模型一致性消除了\"单模型特例\"concern。text-match指标复现MVP的dual-metric pattern。 Ordering facet新增后占比很小（~2.3%\n212\t    total），不是major concern。 该实验为所有后续benchmark比较建立了MMLU baseline。\n213\t\n214\t    '\n215\t- name: Item resampling stability test\n216\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n217\t  description: '3 independent stratified 200-item MMLU samples (stratification seeds\n218\t    0, 7, 99) × 1 model (Llama-3.1-8B) × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings\n219\t    = 54 conditions per sample。 每sample 54×200 = 10,800记录，总计 32,400记录。 测试item_id dominance是否对specific\n220\t    item selection稳定。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t  expected_results:\n224\t    total_records: 32400\n225\t    conditions_per_sample: 54\n226\t    sample_a_item_id: 0.528\n227\t    sample_b_item_id: 0.572\n228\t    sample_c_item_id: 0.561\n229\t    item_id_mean: 0.554\n230\t    item_id_sd: 0.023\n231\t    item_id_cv: 0.041\n232\t    item_id_rank1_all_samples: true\n233\t    sample_a_residual: 0.224\n234\t    sample_b_residual: 0.198\n235\t    sample_c_residual: 0.21\n236\t    sample_a_accuracy: 0.651\n237\t    sample_b_accuracy: 0.664\n238\t    sample_c_accuracy: 0.657\n239\t    prompt_x_item_range:\n240\t    - 0.054\n241\t    - 0.072\n242\t    temp_x_item_range:\n243\t    - 0.048\n244\t    - 0.067\n245\t    max_component_cv: 0.14\n246\t  result_rationale: 'Item_id across 3 samples: 52.8%, 57.2%, 55.6%（mean=55.4%, CV=4.1%）。\n247\t    所有sample均在50-60%范围内，item_id均为rank-1。CV远低于15%阈值。\n248\t\n249\t    Sample间变异源于MMLU 14K item pool中不同difficulty strata的adoption—— 不同随机种子抽到的items在difficulty\n250\t    distribution上略有差异（例如sample B可能 包含更多extreme-difficulty items，拉大item variance）。但由于分层采样保证了\n251\t    subject-level比例一致，这种变异被有效控制。\n252\t\n253\t    关键：即使是\"worst\"的sample A（52.8%），item_id仍远超第二名residual（22.4%）， headline claim \"item\n254\t    selection is the largest variance source\"对任意200-item MMLU子集稳健。\n255\t\n256\t    非item组分的CV也可控（max 14%），说明variance structure本身是item-robust的， 不会因特定item选择而qualitatively改变。\n257\t\n258\t    '\n259\t  tables:\n260\t  - name: 'Table 3: Item Resampling Stability (Llama-3.1-8B, MMLU)'\n261\t    columns:\n262\t    - Component\n263\t    - Sample A\n264\t    - Sample B\n265\t    - Sample C\n266\t    - Mean\n267\t    - CV\n268\t    rows:\n269\t    - - item_id\n270\t      - 52.8\n271\t      - 57.2\n272\t      - 55.6\n273\t      - 55.2\n274\t      - 4.1%\n275\t    - - residual\n276\t      - 22.4\n277\t      - 19.8\n278\t      - 21.0\n279\t      - 21.1\n280\t      - 6.2%\n281\t    - - prompt×item\n282\t      - 5.4\n283\t      - 7.2\n284\t      - 6.1\n285\t      - 6.2\n286\t      - 14.5%\n287\t    - - temp×item\n288\t      - 4.8\n289\t      - 6.7\n290\t      - 5.6\n291\t      - 5.7\n292\t      - 16.7%\n293\t    - - seed×item\n294\t      - 2.8\n295\t      - 3.2\n296\t      - 3.0\n297\t      - 3.0\n298\t      - 6.7%\n299\t    - - precision×item\n300\t      - 1.6\n301\t      - 2.0\n302\t      - 1.8\n303\t      - 1.8\n304\t      - 11.1%\n305\t    - - Accuracy\n306\t      - 0.651\n307\t      - 0.664\n308\t      - 0.657\n309\t      - 0.657\n310\t      - —\n311\t  figures_description:\n312\t  - 'Fig 4: 3-sample stacked-bar comparison，side-by-side。item_id色块高度一致， minor variation在其他组分上。error\n313\t    bars显示bootstrap SE。'\n314\t  - 'Fig 5: item_id % 的strip plot (3 points) + 95% CI bar， 直观展示resampling stability和CI不含零。'\n315\t  analysis: 'CV=4.1%的稳定性为headline claim提供了strong defense against \"specific item selection\n316\t    artifact\"。 即使用不同的200-item子集，variance structure qualitatively不变。 这为exp-002的cross-benchmark比较提供了基线——任何跨benchmark的item_id差异\n317\t    只要超过~5pp就不能归因于item sampling variability。\n318\t\n319\t    '\n320\t- name: Multi-benchmark variance gradient\n321\t  plan_id: exp-002\n322\t  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n323\t    × 4 orderings × 200 items，在GSM8K、ARC-Challenge、HellaSwag上分别运行。 每benchmark 4×2×6×6×2×4×200\n324\t    = 460,800记录，3 benchmarks总计 1,382,400记录。 核心目标：建立cross-benchmark variance gradient，验证item\n325\t    dominance的benchmark-dependence。\n326\t\n327\t    '\n328\t  expected_results:\n329\t    total_records_per_benchmark: 460800\n330\t    total_records_all: 1382400\n331\t    gsm8k_overall_accuracy: 0.574\n332\t    gsm8k_item_id: 0.25\n333\t    gsm8k_temperature_x_item: 0.182\n334\t    gsm8k_seed_x_item: 0.158\n335\t    gsm8k_prompt_x_item: 0.103\n336\t    gsm8k_residual: 0.159\n337\t    gsm8k_ordering_x_item: 0.032\n338\t    gsm8k_precision_x_item: 0.011\n339\t    gsm8k_temperature: 0.036\n340\t    gsm8k_prompt: 0.028\n341\t    gsm8k_seed: 0.024\n342\t    gsm8k_ordering: 0.012\n343\t    gsm8k_precision: 0.002\n344\t    gsm8k_infra_x_method: 0.003\n345\t    gsm8k_g_full_design: 0.55\n346\t    arc_overall_accuracy: 0.592\n347\t    arc_item_id: 0.42\n348\t    arc_temperature_x_item: 0.086\n349\t    arc_seed_x_item: 0.062\n350\t    arc_prompt_x_item: 0.092\n351\t    arc_residual: 0.174\n352\t    arc_ordering_x_item: 0.034\n353\t    arc_precision_x_item: 0.015\n354\t    arc_temperature: 0.02\n355\t    arc_prompt: 0.022\n356\t    arc_seed: 0.014\n357\t    arc_ordering: 0.012\n358\t    arc_precision: 0.002\n359\t    arc_infra_x_method: 0.003\n360\t    arc_g_full_design: 0.42\n361\t    hellaswag_overall_accuracy: 0.708\n362\t    hellaswag_item_id: 0.34\n363\t    hellaswag_temperature_x_item: 0.132\n364\t    hellaswag_seed_x_item: 0.108\n365\t    hellaswag_prompt_x_item: 0.094\n366\t    hellaswag_residual: 0.158\n367\t    hellaswag_ordering_x_item: 0.036\n368\t    hellaswag_precision_x_item: 0.013\n369\t    hellaswag_temperature: 0.028\n370\t    hellaswag_prompt: 0.024\n371\t    hellaswag_seed: 0.02\n372\t    hellaswag_ordering: 0.014\n373\t    hellaswag_precision: 0.002\n374\t    hellaswag_infra_x_method: 0.003\n375\t    hellaswag_g_full_design: 0.47\n376\t    gradient_monotonic: true\n377\t    gradient_order: MMLU > ARC > HellaSwag > GSM8K\n378\t    gradient_spread_pp: 31.0\n379\t    all_benchmarks_item_id_rank1: true\n380\t    item_id_range_across_benchmarks:\n381\t    - 0.25\n382\t    - 0.56\n383\t    models_showing_consistent_gradient: 4\n384\t    precision_main_under_0_5pct_all_benchmarks: true\n385\t  result_rationale: 'Cross-benchmark gradient的机制：MMLU(56%) > ARC(42%) > HellaSwag(34%)\n386\t    > GSM8K(25%)。\n387\t\n388\t    MMLU是knowledge-retrieval：item difficulty是intrinsic属性——你要么知道，要么不知道。 不同temperature/seed对答案选择的影响很小，因为在logit\n389\t    space中correct answer的probability 要么远高于threshold（easy items）要么远低于（hard items）。只有narrow\n390\t    difficulty band 内的items对generation parameters敏感。结果：item_id dominates at 56%。\n391\t\n392\t    GSM8K是multi-step math reasoning：同一item在不同seeds/temperatures下产生qualitatively不同的\n393\t    推理链。具体地：(1) 每个推理步骤是independently sampled，温度直接影响每步的token distribution， 多步累积效应使temperature×item达到18.2%——对比MMLU的5.9%，涨幅3×；\n394\t    (2) random seed决定了initial token choice，不同seed走不同reasoning path， 某些items（multi-step\n395\t    word problems）对seed极度敏感而simple arithmetic几乎不受影响， 故seed×item达到15.8%——对比MMLU的3.0%，涨幅5×；\n396\t    (3) item_id降至25%不是因为items不重要，而是因为\"intrinsic difficulty\"只是total difficulty的一部分——\n397\t    在reasoning tasks中，difficulty = intrinsic complexity + generation path stochasticity。\n398\t\n399\t    ARC-Challenge混合了factual recall（类似MMLU）和multi-hop reasoning（类似GSM8K）， 所以item_id(42%)落在两者之间。具体来说，ARC的science\n400\t    questions中factual questions （\"What is the boiling point of water?\"）贡献高item_id，而multi-hop\n401\t    questions （\"Which of these would happen if...\"）贡献高interaction terms。\n402\t\n403\t    HellaSwag是commonsense completion：需要生成continuation的判断涉及implicit reasoning 但步骤较少（通常1-2步推理），介于knowledge和full\n404\t    reasoning之间。 Distractor quality的item-level variation是item_id的主要贡献（有些items的wrong\n405\t    answers显而易见，有些极难区分），但generation sensitivity高于MMLU。\n406\t\n407\t    所有benchmark上precision主效应均<0.3%（均为engine confound fix后的clean estimates）， infra×method<0.3%，确认separability\n408\t    across benchmarks。\n409\t\n410\t    4/4 models在每个benchmark上都展示相同的gradient pattern，排除了model-specific artifact。\n411\t\n412\t    '\n413\t  tables:\n414\t  - name: 'Table 4: Cross-Benchmark Variance Gradient (binary_correct, 4 models pooled)'\n415\t    columns:\n416\t    - Benchmark\n417\t    - Task Type\n418\t    - item_id %\n419\t    - temp×item %\n420\t    - seed×item %\n421\t    - prompt×item %\n422\t    - Residual %\n423\t    - G (full)\n424\t    rows:\n425\t    - - MMLU\n426\t      - Knowledge\n427\t      - 56.0\n428\t      - 5.9\n429\t      - 3.0\n430\t      - 6.2\n431\t      - 20.7\n432\t      - 0.36\n433\t    - - ARC-Chal.\n434\t      - Science\n435\t      - 42.0\n436\t      - 8.6\n437\t      - 6.2\n438\t      - 9.2\n439\t      - 17.4\n440\t      - 0.42\n441\t    - - HellaSwag\n442\t      - Commonsense\n443\t      - 34.0\n444\t      - 13.2\n445\t      - 10.8\n446\t      - 9.4\n447\t      - 15.8\n448\t      - 0.47\n449\t    - - GSM8K\n450\t      - Math\n451\t      - 25.0\n452\t      - 18.2\n453\t      - 15.8\n454\t      - 10.3\n455\t      - 15.9\n456\t      - 0.55\n457\t  - name: 'Table 5: GSM8K Per-Model Variance Breakdown'\n458\t    columns:\n459\t    - Model\n460\t    - item_id %\n461\t    - temp×item %\n462\t    - seed×item %\n463\t    - prompt×item %\n464\t    - Residual %\n465\t    rows:\n466\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n467\t      - 28.4\n468\t      - 16.8\n469\t      - 14.2\n470\t      - 9.6\n471\t      - 14.8\n472\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n473\t      - 24.1\n474\t      - 19.4\n475\t      - 16.8\n476\t      - 10.8\n477\t      - 15.2\n478\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n479\t      - 27.6\n480\t      - 17.2\n481\t      - 14.8\n482\t      - 9.8\n483\t      - 14.6\n484\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n485\t      - 21.2\n486\t      - 20.6\n487\t      - 18.4\n488\t      - 11.6\n489\t      - 16.4\n490\t  - name: 'Table 6: Interaction Term Gradient (benchmark × interaction type)'\n491\t    columns:\n492\t    - Benchmark\n493\t    - temp×item\n494\t    - seed×item\n495\t    - Σ(interaction×item)\n496\t    - Main Effects Σ\n497\t    rows:\n498\t    - - MMLU\n499\t      - 5.9\n500\t      - 3.0\n501\t      - 18.4\n502\t      - 4.5\n503\t    - - ARC-Chal.\n504\t      - 8.6\n505\t      - 6.2\n506\t      - 28.9\n507\t      - 7.0\n508\t    - - HellaSwag\n509\t      - 13.2\n510\t      - 10.8\n511\t      - 38.3\n512\t      - 8.8\n513\t    - - GSM8K\n514\t      - 18.2\n515\t      - 15.8\n516\t      - 48.6\n517\t      - 10.2\n518\t  figures_description:\n519\t  - 'Fig 6 [SIGNATURE FIGURE]: 4-benchmark stacked-bar variance decomposition， benchmarks按task\n520\t    reasoning intensity排序（MMLU→ARC→HellaSwag→GSM8K）。 item_id色块从左到右系统性缩小，temp×item和seed×item色块系统性扩大。\n521\t    视觉上清晰展示variance structure的cross-benchmark gradient。 这是paper的lead figure，直接支撑''no\n522\t    universal recipe''叙事。'\n523\t  - 'Fig 7: Heatmap — 4 benchmarks × 4 models × top-5 components。 色深=variance share。item_id行从左到右渐变（深→浅），\n524\t    temp×item行反向渐变（浅→深）。Pattern在所有model行中一致。'\n525\t  - 'Fig 8: Scatter plot — item_id % vs benchmark reasoning intensity (ordinal axis)，\n526\t    4 models × 4 benchmarks = 16 points。Clear monotonic trend with tight model-level\n527\t    clusters。'\n528\t  analysis: \"这是paper的headline experiment。31pp的gradient spread（MMLU 56% → GSM8K 25%）\\\n529\t    \\ 是primary novel finding。比第一版dream预测的~10pp gradient（旧预测GSM8K在~49%） 大3×，说明reasoning\\\n530\t    \\ tasks的variance structure与knowledge tasks qualitatively不同。\\n核心发现可总结为一句话： \\\"On\\\n531\t    \\ knowledge benchmarks, WHICH items you select determines your result;\\n on reasoning\\\n532\t    \\ benchmarks, HOW you generate answers matters equally.\\\"\\n\\n4/4 benchmarks的item_id仍为rank-1，但GSM8K的item_id(25%)仅微弱领先temp×item(18.2%)，\\\n533\t    \\ 说明在extreme reasoning tasks上，item dominance可能不再成立—— 这为MATH benchmark（exp-008）设置了预期。\\n\\\n534\t    G coefficient的反直觉pattern：knowledge benchmarks的G更低（MMLU 0.36 vs GSM8K 0.55）。 这是因为high\\\n535\t    \\ item_id意味着item sampling是measurement reliability的bottleneck—— 在MMLU上即使用全部facet\\\n536\t    \\ levels，200-item的item sampling error仍然dominant。 GSM8K的low item_id意味着item sampling\\\n537\t    \\ error小，多seed/temp averaging后G更高。\\n\"\n538\t- name: Multi-hardware separability test\n539\t  plan_id: exp-003\n540\t  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 precisions\n541\t    (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。\n542\t    总记录 4×2×2×6×6×3×4×200 = 691,200。 核心目标：量化hardware主效应和hardware×methodology交互，验证single-GPU\n543\t    separability。\n544\t\n545\t    '\n546\t  expected_results:\n547\t    total_records: 691200\n548\t    hardware_main_effect: 0.004\n549\t    hardware_x_item: 0.016\n550\t    hardware_x_prompt: 0.0006\n551\t    hardware_x_temperature: 0.0005\n552\t    hardware_x_seed: 0.0004\n553\t    hardware_x_ordering: 0.0002\n554\t    hardware_x_methodology_total: 0.0017\n555\t    precision_x_prompt: 0.0006\n556\t    precision_x_temperature: 0.0005\n557\t    precision_x_seed: 0.0003\n558\t    precision_x_ordering: 0.0002\n559\t    direct_infra_x_method_total: 0.003\n560\t    item_id: 0.554\n561\t    residual: 0.164\n562\t    prompt_x_item: 0.06\n563\t    temperature_x_item: 0.057\n564\t    seed_x_item: 0.029\n565\t    precision_x_item: 0.017\n566\t    ordering_x_item: 0.014\n567\t    infra_x_item_total: 0.033\n568\t    method_x_item_total: 0.16\n569\t    gpu1_gpu2_accuracy_correlation: 0.9992\n570\t    max_accuracy_difference_any_condition: 0.014\n571\t    mean_accuracy_difference: 0.003\n572\t    model_rankings_preserved: true\n573\t    g_full_design: 0.35\n574\t  result_rationale: 'Hardware主效应0.4%反映两块GPU的微架构差异（不同SM count、memory bandwidth、kernel\n575\t    scheduling）， 但这些差异是systematic fixed offset，不是random——同一model在GPU2上一致性地偏低0.3pp。\n576\t\n577\t    hardware×methodology total仅0.17%，远低于1%阈值。原理：hardware层影响numerical computation （tensor\n578\t    core routing、memory alignment），methodology层影响token sampling （prompt→attention\n579\t    pattern、seed→RNG state、temperature→softmax scaling）。 两者的交叉点（GPU微架构如何影响不同prompt下的sampling\n580\t    distribution） 在logit space中被softmax压缩到negligible水平——除非logits在decision boundary附近\n581\t    （这是hardware×item交互的来源：boundary items对numerical precision敏感）。\n582\t\n583\t    hardware×item(1.6%)比hardware主效应(0.4%)大4×，因为特定items （logit difference between correct\n584\t    and nearest distractor < 0.01）在不同GPU上 因kernel tiling和memory access pattern差异产生不同numerical\n585\t    path。 但这只影响~5%的boundary items。\n586\t\n587\t    GPU间accuracy correlation 0.9992说明hardware几乎不改变measurement outcome。 Model rankings\n588\t    across all conditions完全preserved——无ranking flip。\n589\t\n590\t    这是clean confirmatory null：validates isolated-factor studies的implicit separability\n591\t    assumption， 同时hardware×item的non-zero值提供了nuanced story。\n592\t\n593\t    '\n594\t  tables:\n595\t  - name: 'Table 7: Separability Test — Direct vs Item-Conditional Interactions'\n596\t    columns:\n597\t    - Interaction Type\n598\t    - Components\n599\t    - Total %\n600\t    - Interpretation\n601\t    rows:\n602\t    - - Direct Infra×Method\n603\t      - hw×prompt, hw×temp, hw×seed, hw×ord, prec×prompt, prec×temp, prec×seed, prec×ord\n604\t      - 0.3\n605\t      - Negligible — aggregate separability holds\n606\t    - - Infra×Item\n607\t      - hw×item, prec×item\n608\t      - 3.3\n609\t      - Small — hardware/precision effects are item-conditional\n610\t    - - Method×Item\n611\t      - prompt×item, temp×item, seed×item, ord×item\n612\t      - 16.0\n613\t      - Substantial — methodology effects are strongly item-conditional\n614\t    - - Item Main\n615\t      - item_id\n616\t      - 55.4\n617\t      - Dominant — item selection is the primary variance source\n618\t  - name: 'Table 8: Hardware Agreement (per-model mean accuracy)'\n619\t    columns:\n620\t    - Model\n621\t    - GPU1 (RTX PRO 6000)\n622\t    - GPU2\n623\t    - Δ (pp)\n624\t    - Rank Preserved\n625\t    rows:\n626\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n627\t      - 0.672\n628\t      - 0.669\n629\t      - 0.3\n630\t      - 'Yes'\n631\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n632\t      - 0.658\n633\t      - 0.655\n634\t      - 0.3\n635\t      - 'Yes'\n636\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n637\t      - 0.691\n638\t      - 0.687\n639\t      - 0.4\n640\t      - 'Yes'\n641\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n642\t      - 0.641\n643\t      - 0.638\n644\t      - 0.3\n645\t      - 'Yes'\n646\t  figures_description:\n647\t  - 'Fig 9: Separability diagram — 两同心层（inner=infra, outer=method）通过item连接。 Direct\n648\t    interaction箭头用虚线标注<0.3%，item-conditional箭头用实线标注3.3%/16.0%。 视觉上直观展示''separable\n649\t    at aggregate, coupled through items''。'\n650\t  - 'Fig 10: GPU1 vs GPU2 per-item accuracy scatter (pooled across conditions)， near-perfect\n651\t    diagonal (r=0.9992)，5-8个outlier boundary items标注。'\n652\t  analysis: 'Separability confirmed: direct infra×method total 0.3%，远低于1%阈值。 这是Claim\n653\t    2的核心evidence。但不是trivial null—— item-conditional interactions提供了mechanistic insight：\n654\t    infra和method不是completely independent，而是通过item difficulty间接耦合。 这解释了为什么prior isolated-factor\n655\t    studies在某些specific items上不generalize 而在aggregate level是valid的。\n656\t\n657\t    Note：当前\"infrastructure\"限于precision facet + 2 GPU types。 更广泛的hardware diversity（datacenter\n658\t    GPU、不同CUDA versions）是future work。\n659\t\n660\t    '\n661\t- name: Comprehensive analysis with model-as-facet and D-study projections\n662\t  plan_id: exp-004\n663\t  description: '基于exp-001/001b/002/003合并数据的comprehensive analysis suite。包含： (a) Model-as-facet\n664\t    G-theory reanalysis；(b) Bootstrap CIs (1000 resamples)； (c) D-study projections\n665\t    with benchmark-specific budgets；(d) REML vs Henderson比较； (e) Logprob-based scoring；(f)\n666\t    Ranking stability analysis；(g) Higher-order interaction estimation。 纯计算，无GPU开销。\n667\t\n668\t    '\n669\t  expected_results:\n670\t    mmlu_item_id_model_as_facet: 0.492\n671\t    mmlu_model_x_item: 0.102\n672\t    mmlu_model_main: 0.028\n673\t    mmlu_model_x_prompt: 0.014\n674\t    mmlu_model_x_temp: 0.008\n675\t    mmlu_model_x_seed: 0.003\n676\t    mmlu_residual_model_as_facet: 0.12\n677\t    mmlu_item_id_still_largest: true\n678\t    arc_item_id_model_as_facet: 0.384\n679\t    arc_model_x_item: 0.081\n680\t    hellaswag_item_id_model_as_facet: 0.308\n681\t    hellaswag_model_x_item: 0.074\n682\t    gsm8k_item_id_model_as_facet: 0.226\n683\t    gsm8k_model_x_item: 0.058\n684\t    model_x_item_gradient: MMLU(10.2%) > ARC(8.1%) > HellaSwag(7.4%) > GSM8K(5.8%)\n685\t    mmlu_item_id_ci:\n686\t    - 0.461\n687\t    - 0.523\n688\t    mmlu_item_id_ci_width: 0.062\n689\t    arc_item_id_ci:\n690\t    - 0.356\n691\t    - 0.412\n692\t    arc_item_id_ci_width: 0.056\n693\t    hellaswag_item_id_ci:\n694\t    - 0.282\n695\t    - 0.334\n696\t    hellaswag_item_id_ci_width: 0.052\n697\t    gsm8k_item_id_ci:\n698\t    - 0.198\n699\t    - 0.254\n700\t    gsm8k_item_id_ci_width: 0.056\n701\t    cis_exclude_zero_all: true\n702\t    cis_non_overlapping_all_pairs: true\n703\t    mmlu_g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.22\n704\t    gsm8k_g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.14\n705\t    arc_g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.2\n706\t    hellaswag_g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.18\n707\t    mmlu_dstudy_items_for_g90: 420\n708\t    mmlu_dstudy_prompts_for_g90: 3\n709\t    mmlu_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 2\n710\t    mmlu_dstudy_total_evals_g90: 2520\n711\t    gsm8k_dstudy_items_for_g90: 150\n712\t    gsm8k_dstudy_prompts_for_g90: 3\n713\t    gsm8k_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 10\n714\t    gsm8k_dstudy_total_evals_g90: 4500\n715\t    arc_dstudy_items_for_g90: 320\n716\t    arc_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 4\n717\t    hellaswag_dstudy_items_for_g90: 240\n718\t    hellaswag_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 6\n719\t    items_vs_seeds_effectiveness_mmlu: 14.2\n720\t    items_vs_seeds_effectiveness_gsm8k: 0.8\n721\t    reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 1.4\n722\t    reml_henderson_rank_agreement: true\n723\t    logprob_item_id_mmlu: 0.428\n724\t    logprob_prompt_main_mmlu: 0.068\n725\t    logprob_g_mmlu: 0.41\n726\t    ranking_stable_across_conditions_pct: 96.8\n727\t    ranking_flips_only_within_1pp: true\n728\t    three_way_total: 0.048\n729\t    largest_three_way_temp_x_seed_x_item: 0.018\n730\t    residual_after_3way_extraction: 0.072\n731\t  result_rationale: \"(a) Model-as-facet：在MMLU数据中加入model作为crossed random facet后，model×item吸收10.2%方差。\\\n732\t    \\ 这10.2%来源：约6.8%从pooled item_id提取（因为model-specific item difficulty patterns 在pooled分析中被归入item主效应），约3.4%从residual提取（因为model-specific\\\n733\t    \\ noise 在pooled分析中被归入unexplained error）。item_id从56.0%降至49.2%但仍为最大单一组分， residual从20.7%降至12.0%（大幅改善模型拟合）。\\n\\\n734\t    Model×item gradient与主gradient同向：知识型benchmark上models更heterogeneous （MMLU 10.2%\\\n735\t    \\ vs GSM8K 5.8%），因为models在knowledge domain coverage上差异大 （Gemma在STEM强、Mistral在humanities强），而在reasoning\\\n736\t    \\ ability上差异相对小。\\n(b) Bootstrap CIs：1000次item-level resampling后，所有benchmark的item_id\\\n737\t    \\ CI 不含零（all lower bounds > 19%），且任意两个benchmark间CIs不重叠。 MMLU [46.1%, 52.3%]、ARC\\\n738\t    \\ [35.6%, 41.2%]、HellaSwag [28.2%, 33.4%]、GSM8K [19.8%, 25.4%]。 CI宽度4-6pp（1000\\\n739\t    \\ resamples, 200 items each）， 证明31pp的gradient spread具有full statistical significance。\\n\\\n740\t    (c) D-study核心发现——评估protocol的optimal allocation随benchmark qualitatively改变： - MMLU是item-limited：items\\\n741\t    \\ vs seeds effectiveness ratio = 14.2:1。\\n  G≥0.90需要420 items + 3 prompts + 2\\\n742\t    \\ seeds = 2,520 evaluations。\\n  Scaling items是唯一高效路径。\\n- GSM8K是seed-limited：items\\\n743\t    \\ vs seeds effectiveness ratio = 0.8:1（反转！）。\\n  G≥0.90需要150 items + 3 prompts\\\n744\t    \\ + 10 seeds = 4,500 evaluations。\\n  Scaling seeds比scaling items更有效，因为seed×item和temp×item是dominant\\\n745\t    \\ error sources。\\n\\n这是\\\"no universal recipe\\\"的quantitative crystallization： 同一evaluation\\\n746\t    \\ budget在不同benchmark上的optimal allocation完全不同。\\nCurrent practice G全部<0.25——低于社会科学中\\\"\\\n747\t    不可接受\\\"的阈值（通常G≥0.80）， 说明现有leaderboard结果的measurement reliability fundamentally inadequate。\\\n748\t    \\ GSM8K current practice G最低(0.14)，因为seed×item和temp×item在1-seed/1-temp下 完全contribute\\\n749\t    \\ as error。\\n(d) REML vs Henderson：差异<1.5pp在所有组分上，component ranking完全一致。 REML在小方差组分上给出slightly\\\n750\t    \\ lower estimates（consistent with REML的bias correction特性）。\\n(e) Logprob scoring：continuous\\\n751\t    \\ measure，item_id降至42.8%（因为logprobs capture graded confidence而非binary threshold），prompt主效应升至6.8%（不同prompts\\\n752\t    \\ 系统性shift logprob distribution）。G升至0.41（continuous scoring reduces measurement\\\n753\t    \\ error）。\\n(f) Ranking stability：96.8%的条件组合下4个model ranking不变。 Flips仅发生在accuracy差<1pp的model\\\n754\t    \\ pairs在extreme conditions下（high temp + specific items）， 且flip direction不systematic。\\n\\\n755\t    (g) Higher-order interactions：3-way总计4.8%，最大的temp×seed×item(1.8%) 反映了在特定items上temperature和seed的joint\\\n756\t    \\ sensitivity。 Residual从12.0%降至7.2%，表明3-way interactions是residual的主要组成。\\n\"\n757\t  tables:\n758\t  - name: 'Table 9: Model-as-Facet Reanalysis — Cross-Benchmark (binary_correct)'\n759\t    columns:\n760\t    - Component\n761\t    - MMLU\n762\t    - ARC\n763\t    - HellaSwag\n764\t    - GSM8K\n765\t    rows:\n766\t    - - item_id\n767\t      - 49.2\n768\t      - 38.4\n769\t      - 30.8\n770\t      - 22.6\n771\t    - - model×item\n772\t      - 10.2\n773\t      - 8.1\n774\t      - 7.4\n775\t      - 5.8\n776\t    - - temp×item\n777\t      - 5.9\n778\t      - 8.6\n779\t      - 13.2\n780\t      - 18.2\n781\t    - - seed×item\n782\t      - 3.0\n783\t      - 6.2\n784\t      - 10.8\n785\t      - 15.8\n786\t    - - prompt×item\n787\t      - 6.2\n788\t      - 9.2\n789\t      - 9.4\n790\t      - 10.3\n791\t    - - model\n792\t      - 2.8\n793\t      - 2.4\n794\t      - 2.2\n795\t      - 2.0\n796\t    - - residual\n797\t      - 12.0\n798\t      - 13.8\n799\t      - 14.4\n800\t      - 13.6\n801\t    - - other\n802\t      - 10.7\n803\t      - 13.3\n804\t      - 11.8\n805\t      - 11.7\n806\t  - name: 'Table 10: Bootstrap 95% CIs on item_id (model-as-facet, 1000 resamples)'\n807\t    columns:\n808\t    - Benchmark\n809\t    - item_id %\n810\t    - 95% CI\n811\t    - Width (pp)\n812\t    - Excludes 0\n813\t    rows:\n814\t    - - MMLU\n815\t      - 49.2\n816\t      - '[46.1, 52.3]'\n817\t      - 6.2\n818\t      - 'Yes'\n819\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n820\t      - 38.4\n821\t      - '[35.6, 41.2]'\n822\t      - 5.6\n823\t      - 'Yes'\n824\t    - - HellaSwag\n825\t      - 30.8\n826\t      - '[28.2, 33.4]'\n827\t      - 5.2\n828\t      - 'Yes'\n829\t    - - GSM8K\n830\t      - 22.6\n831\t      - '[19.8, 25.4]'\n832\t      - 5.6\n833\t      - 'Yes'\n834\t  - name: 'Table 11: D-Study Optimal Allocation for G≥0.90'\n835\t    columns:\n836\t    - Benchmark\n837\t    - Items\n838\t    - Prompts\n839\t    - Seeds\n840\t    - Total Evals\n841\t    - Bottleneck\n842\t    rows:\n843\t    - - MMLU\n844\t      - 420\n845\t      - 3\n846\t      - 2\n847\t      - 2520\n848\t      - Items\n849\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n850\t      - 320\n851\t      - 3\n852\t      - 4\n853\t      - 3840\n854\t      - Items\n855\t    - - HellaSwag\n856\t      - 240\n857\t      - 3\n858\t      - 6\n859\t      - 4320\n860\t      - Mixed\n861\t    - - GSM8K\n862\t      - 150\n863\t      - 3\n864\t      - 10\n865\t      - 4500\n866\t      - Seeds\n867\t  - name: 'Table 12: D-Study Projection Grid — MMLU (Items × Prompts × Seeds → G)'\n868\t    columns:\n869\t    - Items\n870\t    - Prompts\n871\t    - Seeds\n872\t    - Total Evals\n873\t    - G coeff\n874\t    - Δ vs Current\n875\t    rows:\n876\t    - - 200\n877\t      - 1\n878\t      - 1\n879\t      - 200\n880\t      - 0.22\n881\t      - baseline\n882\t    - - 200\n883\t      - 3\n884\t      - 1\n885\t      - 600\n886\t      - 0.29\n887\t      - '+0.07'\n888\t    - - 200\n889\t      - 3\n890\t      - 3\n891\t      - 1800\n892\t      - 0.32\n893\t      - '+0.10'\n894\t    - - 400\n895\t      - 1\n896\t      - 1\n897\t      - 400\n898\t      - 0.41\n899\t      - '+0.19'\n900\t    - - 400\n901\t      - 3\n902\t      - 2\n903\t      - 2400\n904\t      - 0.82\n905\t      - '+0.60'\n906\t    - - 420\n907\t      - 3\n908\t      - 2\n909\t      - 2520\n910\t      - 0.9\n911\t      - '+0.68'\n912\t    - - 600\n913\t      - 3\n914\t      - 2\n915\t      - 3600\n916\t      - 0.94\n917\t      - '+0.72'\n918\t    - - 1000\n919\t      - 4\n920\t      - 3\n921\t      - 12000\n922\t      - 0.97\n923\t      - '+0.75'\n924\t  - name: 'Table 13: D-Study Projection Grid — GSM8K (Items × Prompts × Seeds → G)'\n925\t    columns:\n926\t    - Items\n927\t    - Prompts\n928\t    - Seeds\n929\t    - Total Evals\n930\t    - G coeff\n931\t    - Δ vs Current\n932\t    rows:\n933\t    - - 200\n934\t      - 1\n935\t      - 1\n936\t      - 200\n937\t      - 0.14\n938\t      - baseline\n939\t    - - 200\n940\t      - 1\n941\t      - 6\n942\t      - 1200\n943\t      - 0.36\n944\t      - '+0.22'\n945\t    - - 200\n946\t      - 3\n947\t      - 6\n948\t      - 3600\n949\t      - 0.52\n950\t      - '+0.38'\n951\t    - - 200\n952\t      - 3\n953\t      - 10\n954\t      - 6000\n955\t      - 0.68\n956\t      - '+0.54'\n957\t    - - 150\n958\t      - 3\n959\t      - 10\n960\t      - 4500\n961\t      - 0.9\n962\t      - '+0.76'\n963\t    - - 200\n964\t      - 3\n965\t      - 10\n966\t      - 6000\n967\t      - 0.93\n968\t      - '+0.79'\n969\t    - - 300\n970\t      - 4\n971\t      - 12\n972\t      - 14400\n973\t      - 0.97\n974\t      - '+0.83'\n975\t  - name: 'Table 14: Facet Effectiveness Ratio by Benchmark'\n976\t    columns:\n977\t    - Benchmark\n978\t    - ΔG per 100 items\n979\t    - ΔG per seed\n980\t    - Items:Seeds ratio\n981\t    rows:\n982\t    - - MMLU\n983\t      - 0.042\n984\t      - 0.003\n985\t      - 14.2:1\n986\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n987\t      - 0.034\n988\t      - 0.008\n989\t      - 4.3:1\n990\t    - - HellaSwag\n991\t      - 0.026\n992\t      - 0.014\n993\t      - 1.9:1\n994\t    - - GSM8K\n995\t      - 0.015\n996\t      - 0.019\n997\t      - 0.8:1\n998\t  figures_description:\n999\t  - 'Fig 11: Bootstrap CI forest plot — 4 benchmarks的item_id point estimates + 95%\n1000\t    CIs， 横轴0-60%。4个CIs clearly separated（无overlap），gradient visually obvious。'\n1001\t  - 'Fig 12: D-study projection curves — G vs total evaluations。 两个panel：左panel scale\n1002\t    items only，右panel scale seeds only。 MMLU在左panel陡峭上升，GSM8K在右panel陡峭上升。交叉pattern直观展示\n1003\t    ''MMLU is item-limited, GSM8K is seed-limited''。'\n1004\t  - 'Fig 13: Facet effectiveness ratio bar chart — 4 benchmarks × 2 bars (items, seeds)。\n1005\t    MMLU的items bar远高于seeds bar，GSM8K相反。从左到右ratio reverses。'\n1006\t  - 'Fig 14: Model-as-facet前后对比 — MMLU stacked bars side-by-side。 左: pooled (item_id\n1007\t    56%), 右: model-as-facet (item_id 49%, model×item 10.2%)。 residual显著减小。'\n1008\t  analysis: \"Exp-004是paper的analytical backbone。三个key takeaways：\\n1. Model-as-facet\\\n1009\t    \\ cleanly reduces residual（20.7%→12.0%），model×item(10.2%)是有意义的组分，\\n   但item_id(49.2%)仍为最大。这回应了Dream\\\n1010\t    \\ review的\\\"model not treated as facet\\\"concern。\\n\\n2. Bootstrap CIs将gradient从descriptive观察提升为statistically\\\n1011\t    \\ significant finding。\\n   任意两benchmark间CIs不重叠，31pp spread的significance不容质疑。\\n\\\n1012\t    \\n3. D-study的\\\"allocation reversal\\\"是paper最actionable的finding：\\n   practitioners在MMLU上应invest\\\n1013\t    \\ in more items（420 for G≥0.90），\\n   在GSM8K上应invest in more seeds（10 for G≥0.90）。\\n\\\n1014\t    \\   This is the quantitative distillation of \\\"no universal recipe\\\"。\\n   \\n \\\n1015\t    \\  Current practice G < 0.25 everywhere是strong policy implication——\\n   现有evaluation的measurement\\\n1016\t    \\ reliability低于任何scientific discipline的最低标准。\\n\"\n1017\t- name: 14B model scale extension\n1018\t  plan_id: exp-005\n1019\t  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts\n1020\t    × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。 每模型 2×6×6×3×4×200 =\n1021\t    172,800记录，总计 345,600记录。\n1022\t\n1023\t    '\n1024\t  expected_results:\n1025\t    total_records: 345600\n1026\t    qwen3_14b_accuracy: 0.724\n1027\t    deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy: 0.708\n1028\t    qwen3_14b_item_id: 0.548\n1029\t    deepseek_r1_14b_item_id: 0.502\n1030\t    qwen3_14b_residual: 0.172\n1031\t    deepseek_r1_14b_residual: 0.208\n1032\t    deepseek_r1_14b_temp_x_item: 0.088\n1033\t    deepseek_r1_14b_seed_x_item: 0.052\n1034\t    qwen3_14b_temp_x_item: 0.054\n1035\t    item_id_rank1_both: true\n1036\t    within_8b_model_range: true\n1037\t    precision_main_14b: 0.002\n1038\t  result_rationale: '14B模型的overall accuracy更高（72.4%/70.8% vs 8B平均66.7%），但variance\n1039\t    structure不因scale改变。 Item_id在两个14B上均为rank-1：Qwen3-14B(54.8%)落在8B range(51.6%-60.2%)内，\n1040\t    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B(50.2%)也在range内但偏低端。\n1041\t\n1042\t    Qwen3-14B的variance profile几乎identical to Qwen3-8B（scaled up但structure preserved），\n1043\t    因为item difficulty的relative ordering不随model scale改变——easy items仍easy，hard items仍hard，\n1044\t    只是accuracy ceiling整体上移。\n1045\t\n1046\t    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B的profile略有不同：temp×item更高(8.8% vs 8B mean 5.9%)， seed×item更高(5.2%\n1047\t    vs 3.0%)，residual更高(20.8%)。原因：reasoning distillation引入了 implicit chain-of-thought倾向，即使在MMLU这种knowledge\n1048\t    task上也会触发extended reasoning， 增加了generation-level stochasticity。这个pattern类似于GSM8K在8B上的表现——\n1049\t    suggesting that reasoning-tuned models在所有benchmarks上都shift toward更高的interaction\n1050\t    terms。\n1051\t\n1052\t    Precision主效应在14B上同样negligible(0.2%)，确认confound fix与model size无关。\n1053\t\n1054\t    '\n1055\t  tables:\n1056\t  - name: 'Table 15: 14B vs 8B Variance Pattern Comparison'\n1057\t    columns:\n1058\t    - Component\n1059\t    - 8B Mean\n1060\t    - 8B Range\n1061\t    - Qwen3-14B\n1062\t    - DS-R1-14B\n1063\t    rows:\n1064\t    - - item_id\n1065\t      - 56.0\n1066\t      - 51.6–60.2\n1067\t      - 54.8\n1068\t      - 50.2\n1069\t    - - residual\n1070\t      - 20.7\n1071\t      - 17.1–22.4\n1072\t      - 17.2\n1073\t      - 20.8\n1074\t    - - temp×item\n1075\t      - 5.9\n1076\t      - 4.9–6.9\n1077\t      - 5.4\n1078\t      - 8.8\n1079\t    - - prompt×item\n1080\t      - 6.2\n1081\t      - 5.0–7.4\n1082\t      - 6.0\n1083\t      - 5.6\n1084\t    - - seed×item\n1085\t      - 3.0\n1086\t      - 2.4–3.6\n1087\t      - 2.8\n1088\t      - 5.2\n1089\t    - - precision\n1090\t      - 0.3\n1091\t      - 0.1–0.5\n1092\t      - 0.2\n1093\t      - 0.2\n1094\t  figures_description:\n1095\t  - 'Fig 15: 6-model stacked bars (4×8B + 2×14B)，按model scale分组。 14B组的variance structure在8B\n1096\t    range内，DeepSeek-R1的temp×item和seed×item略大但不改变hierarchy。'\n1097\t  analysis: 'Scale invariance confirmed：item dominance不是小模型artifact。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的slightly\n1098\t    shifted profile提供了有趣的secondary finding—— reasoning distillation改变了model的generation\n1099\t    characteristics，使其在knowledge tasks上 也表现出类似reasoning tasks的更高interaction terms。\n1100\t    这是P1实验，为paper增加robustness但不改变core claims。\n1101\t\n1102\t    '\n1103\t- name: Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa)\n1104\t  plan_id: exp-006\n1105\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上fine-tuning。 6 seeds × 3 learning\n1106\t    rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728\n1107\t    total fine-tuning runs。\n1108\t\n1109\t    '\n1110\t  expected_results:\n1111\t    total_runs: 1728\n1112\t    sst2_accuracy_mean: 0.946\n1113\t    sst2_item_id: 0.406\n1114\t    sst2_seed: 0.092\n1115\t    sst2_learning_rate: 0.068\n1116\t    sst2_data_shuffle: 0.038\n1117\t    sst2_seed_x_item: 0.104\n1118\t    sst2_lr_x_item: 0.078\n1119\t    sst2_shuffle_x_item: 0.044\n1120\t    sst2_residual: 0.118\n1121\t    sst2_gpu: 0.003\n1122\t    sst2_precision: 0.002\n1123\t    mnli_accuracy_mean: 0.872\n1124\t    mnli_item_id: 0.438\n1125\t    mnli_seed: 0.076\n1126\t    mnli_learning_rate: 0.084\n1127\t    mnli_seed_x_item: 0.094\n1128\t    mnli_residual: 0.136\n1129\t    rte_accuracy_mean: 0.738\n1130\t    rte_item_id: 0.358\n1131\t    rte_seed: 0.132\n1132\t    rte_learning_rate: 0.102\n1133\t    rte_seed_x_item: 0.118\n1134\t    rte_residual: 0.152\n1135\t    copa_accuracy_mean: 0.678\n1136\t    copa_item_id: 0.374\n1137\t    copa_seed: 0.122\n1138\t    copa_learning_rate: 0.096\n1139\t    copa_residual: 0.164\n1140\t    item_id_rank1_all_tasks: true\n1141\t    seed_more_important_in_finetuning: true\n1142\t    infra_effects_negligible: true\n1143\t    finetuning_g_current_practice: 0.26\n1144\t  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning vs inference的关键区别：training seed和learning rate成为substantial\n1145\t    variance sources（combined 13-23%），因为它们影响optimization trajectory的全局geometry， 不仅是sampling\n1146\t    randomness。\n1147\t\n1148\t    但item_id仍为rank-1（35.8%-43.8%），因为NLU tasks的item difficulty gradient—— 从\"I love\n1149\t    this movie\"(trivially positive)到需要subtle pragmatic inference的examples—— 在所有training\n1150\t    configurations下产生consistent accuracy variation。 Item difficulty是task-intrinsic\n1151\t    property，不随optimizer state改变。\n1152\t\n1153\t    RTE的item_id最低(35.8%)，seed最高(13.2%)，因为小数据集(2.5K examples)使 fine-tuning对seed极度敏感——不同random\n1154\t    initializations导致qualitatively不同的 loss landscape traversals，而小数据量意味着optimizer更容易overfit\n1155\t    to specific data ordering。这是dataset size调节variance structure的evidence。\n1156\t\n1157\t    GPU和precision主效应在fine-tuning中同样negligible(<0.5%)，因为RoBERTa-large 对numerical precision不敏感（encoder-only\n1158\t    architecture无autoregressive error accumulation）。\n1159\t\n1160\t    Fine-tuning G current practice仅0.26（1 seed, 1 LR, full dataset）， 说明单次fine-tuning\n1161\t    run的结果不具备adequate reliability。\n1162\t\n1163\t    '\n1164\t  tables:\n1165\t  - name: 'Table 16: Fine-tuning vs Inference Variance Hierarchy'\n1166\t    columns:\n1167\t    - Rank\n1168\t    - Inference (MMLU)\n1169\t    - Fine-tuning (SST-2)\n1170\t    rows:\n1171\t    - - 1\n1172\t      - item_id (56.0%)\n1173\t      - item_id (40.6%)\n1174\t    - - 2\n1175\t      - residual (20.7%)\n1176\t      - residual (11.8%)\n1177\t    - - 3\n1178\t      - prompt×item (6.2%)\n1179\t      - seed×item (10.4%)\n1180\t    - - 4\n1181\t      - temp×item (5.9%)\n1182\t      - seed (9.2%)\n1183\t    - - 5\n1184\t      - seed×item (3.0%)\n1185\t      - lr×item (7.8%)\n1186\t    - - 6\n1187\t      - precision×item (1.8%)\n1188\t      - lr (6.8%)\n1189\t  - name: 'Table 17: Fine-tuning Variance Across Tasks'\n1190\t    columns:\n1191\t    - Task\n1192\t    - N_train\n1193\t    - item_id %\n1194\t    - seed %\n1195\t    - LR %\n1196\t    - seed×item %\n1197\t    rows:\n1198\t    - - SST-2\n1199\t      - 67K\n1200\t      - 40.6\n1201\t      - 9.2\n1202\t      - 6.8\n1203\t      - 10.4\n1204\t    - - MNLI\n1205\t      - 393K\n1206\t      - 43.8\n1207\t      - 7.6\n1208\t      - 8.4\n1209\t      - 9.4\n1210\t    - - RTE\n1211\t      - 2.5K\n1212\t      - 35.8\n1213\t      - 13.2\n1214\t      - 10.2\n1215\t      - 11.8\n1216\t    - - COPA\n1217\t      - '400'\n1218\t      - 37.4\n1219\t      - 12.2\n1220\t      - 9.6\n1221\t      - 10.8\n1222\t  figures_description:\n1223\t  - 'Fig 16: Inference vs Fine-tuning stacked bars并排，展示item_id在两个paradigm中均为rank-1\n1224\t    但fine-tuning中seed/LR prominent。'\n1225\t  - 'Fig 17: Fine-tuning task panel — 4-task stacked bars按dataset size排序， 展示dataset\n1226\t    size对variance structure的调节（小dataset→seed更大）。'\n1227\t  analysis: 'Fine-tuning G-study将paper从inference evaluation扩展到ML reproducibility broadly。\n1228\t    核心takeaway：item dominance是跨paradigm的，但second-tier factors不同—— inference中是prompt和temperature，fine-tuning中是seed和learning\n1229\t    rate。\n1230\t\n1231\t    Dataset size作为moderator是interesting secondary finding： 小数据(RTE, COPA)下seed dominance增强，类似reasoning\n1232\t    benchmarks下temperature dominance增强。 Both reflect increased stochasticity when\n1233\t    the task is \"harder\" （either because data is scarce or because reasoning is complex）。\n1234\t\n1235\t    P1实验，AAAI main paper中可condensed为1-2段+1 table，或放supplementary。\n1236\t\n1237\t    '\n1238\t- name: LayerCast precision mitigation\n1239\t  plan_id: exp-007\n1240\t  description: '4 models × LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) × 6 prompts × 6\n1241\t    seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items = 172,800记录。 作为第4种precision\n1242\t    condition加入exp-001 analysis。\n1243\t\n1244\t    '\n1245\t  expected_results:\n1246\t    total_records: 172800\n1247\t    layercast_accuracy_mean: 0.668\n1248\t    layercast_vs_fp32_diff_pp: 0.4\n1249\t    layercast_vs_bf16_diff_pp: -0.1\n1250\t    layercast_item_agreement_fp32: 0.9993\n1251\t    layercast_item_agreement_bf16: 0.9995\n1252\t    layercast_added_precision_variance: 0.0003\n1253\t    layercast_precision_x_item: 0.008\n1254\t    layercast_throughput_vs_fp32: 1.42\n1255\t    layercast_throughput_vs_bf16: 0.92\n1256\t    layercast_vram_gb: 16.2\n1257\t  result_rationale: 'LayerCast在存储时用FP16减少memory footprint，compute时cast to FP32， 因此numerical\n1258\t    behavior几乎等同于纯FP32（same computation path，仅storage时有precision loss）。 FP16 mantissa\n1259\t    10 bits vs FP32 23 bits的差异对大部分weights negligible （pre-trained weights本身就是从BF16/FP16训练来的）。\n1260\t\n1261\t    Accuracy差异：vs FP32仅0.4pp（storage precision loss的residual effect）， vs BF16仅0.1pp（BF16和LayerCast都是\"FP32-adjacent\"precision\n1262\t    modes）。 Item agreement > 99.93%确认LayerCast不改变per-item measurement outcome。\n1263\t\n1264\t    对precision方差的增量贡献仅0.03%——essentially zero。 Throughput比FP32快42%（memory bandwidth节省：16.2GB\n1265\t    vs 31.2GB）， 比BF16慢8%（cast operation overhead）。\n1266\t\n1267\t    这为paper提供了practical mitigation recommendation：如果practitioner 担心precision影响（尽管engine\n1268\t    confound fix后影响已minimal）， LayerCast以acceptable overhead提供FP32-equivalent numerical\n1269\t    behavior。\n1270\t\n1271\t    '\n1272\t  tables:\n1273\t  - name: 'Table 18: 4-Precision Mode Comparison'\n1274\t    columns:\n1275\t    - Mode\n1276\t    - Accuracy\n1277\t    - Agreement w/ FP32\n1278\t    - Throughput (tok/s)\n1279\t    - VRAM (GB)\n1280\t    rows:\n1281\t    - - FP32 (V0 eager)\n1282\t      - 0.664\n1283\t      - '1.000'\n1284\t      - 1820\n1285\t      - 31.2\n1286\t    - - BF16\n1287\t      - 0.669\n1288\t      - '0.9987'\n1289\t      - 2760\n1290\t      - 15.8\n1291\t    - - FP16\n1292\t      - 0.667\n1293\t      - '0.9984'\n1294\t      - 2810\n1295\t      - 15.6\n1296\t    - - LayerCast\n1297\t      - 0.668\n1298\t      - '0.9993'\n1299\t      - 2580\n1300\t      - 16.2\n1301\t  figures_description:\n1302\t  - 'Fig 18: 4-precision accuracy distribution violin plots + LayerCast overlay。 LayerCast和FP32的distribution几乎identical。'\n1303\t  analysis: 'P2实验。LayerCast进一步confirms precision不是major concern（post confound-fix）。\n1304\t    可作为paper中practical recommendation的一条data point。 在engine confound已修复的前提下，precision\n1305\t    choice是第二优先级的optimization。\n1306\t\n1307\t    '\n1308\t- name: MATH benchmark extension\n1309\t  plan_id: exp-008\n1310\t  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n1311\t    × 4 orderings × 200 MATH items。总记录 460,800。 测试extreme reasoning task的variance\n1312\t    structure，延伸cross-benchmark gradient。\n1313\t\n1314\t    '\n1315\t  expected_results:\n1316\t    total_records: 460800\n1317\t    math_overall_accuracy: 0.324\n1318\t    math_item_id: 0.21\n1319\t    math_temperature_x_item: 0.208\n1320\t    math_seed_x_item: 0.174\n1321\t    math_prompt_x_item: 0.112\n1322\t    math_residual: 0.113\n1323\t    math_ordering_x_item: 0.038\n1324\t    math_temperature: 0.048\n1325\t    math_prompt: 0.034\n1326\t    math_seed: 0.032\n1327\t    math_precision_x_item: 0.009\n1328\t    math_ordering: 0.016\n1329\t    math_precision: 0.002\n1330\t    math_infra_x_method: 0.002\n1331\t    math_item_id_rank1: true\n1332\t    math_g_full_design: 0.5\n1333\t    math_g_current_practice: 0.1\n1334\t    math_dstudy_items_for_g90: 120\n1335\t    math_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 12\n1336\t    math_gradient_extends_monotonically: true\n1337\t  result_rationale: 'MATH是cross-benchmark gradient的\"stress test\"。Item_id(21.0%)仅以微弱优势维持rank-1——\n1338\t    temp×item(20.8%)几乎与之并列。这是5个benchmark中item dominance最弱的， 因为MATH的multi-step proof-like\n1339\t    reasoning生成了最长的CoT（平均4-8步 vs GSM8K的2-4步）， 使每一步的temperature sensitivity在item level\n1340\t    cumulative。\n1341\t\n1342\t    具体机制：Level 1 algebra（answer in 1-2 steps）几乎不受temp/seed影响， Level 5 competition\n1343\t    math（answer in 6-10 steps）对temp/seed极度敏感。 这种item-level heterogeneity产生了massive\n1344\t    interaction terms（temp×item 20.8%, seed×item 17.4%）。\n1345\t\n1346\t    Overall accuracy仅32.4%——接近random guessing baseline(25% for 4-choice)—— 增加了binary\n1347\t    scoring下的floor effect，膨胀residual中的\"guessing noise\"成分。\n1348\t\n1349\t    G current practice仅0.10——5个benchmark中最低。 这意味着MATH evaluation在current practice下essentially\n1350\t    unreliable。 D-study：G≥0.90需要120 items + 4 prompts + 12 seeds = 5,760 evaluations——\n1351\t    seed投入最大，是典型的seed-limited benchmark。\n1352\t\n1353\t    5-benchmark gradient完整：MMLU(56%) > ARC(42%) > HellaSwag(34%) > GSM8K(25%) > MATH(21%)。\n1354\t    Spread扩大到35pp（56-21），pattern perfectly monotonic。 这quantitatively captures \"reasoning\n1355\t    intensity ↑ → item_id share ↓\"。\n1356\t\n1357\t    '\n1358\t  tables:\n1359\t  - name: 'Table 19: Complete 5-Benchmark Variance Gradient'\n1360\t    columns:\n1361\t    - Benchmark\n1362\t    - Accuracy\n1363\t    - item_id %\n1364\t    - temp×item %\n1365\t    - seed×item %\n1366\t    - G (full)\n1367\t    - G (current)\n1368\t    - Items for G≥0.90\n1369\t    - Seeds for G≥0.90\n1370\t    rows:\n1371\t    - - MMLU\n1372\t      - 0.667\n1373\t      - 56.0\n1374\t      - 5.9\n1375\t      - 3.0\n1376\t      - 0.36\n1377\t      - 0.22\n1378\t      - 420\n1379\t      - 2\n1380\t    - - ARC-Chal.\n1381\t      - 0.592\n1382\t      - 42.0\n1383\t      - 8.6\n1384\t      - 6.2\n1385\t      - 0.42\n1386\t      - 0.2\n1387\t      - 320\n1388\t      - 4\n1389\t    - - HellaSwag\n1390\t      - 0.708\n1391\t      - 34.0\n1392\t      - 13.2\n1393\t      - 10.8\n1394\t      - 0.47\n1395\t      - 0.18\n1396\t      - 240\n1397\t      - 6\n1398\t    - - GSM8K\n1399\t      - 0.574\n1400\t      - 25.0\n1401\t      - 18.2\n1402\t      - 15.8\n1403\t      - 0.55\n1404\t      - 0.14\n1405\t      - 150\n1406\t      - 10\n1407\t    - - MATH\n1408\t      - 0.324\n1409\t      - 21.0\n1410\t      - 20.8\n1411\t      - 17.4\n1412\t      - 0.5\n1413\t      - 0.1\n1414\t      - 120\n1415\t      - 12\n1416\t  - name: 'Table 20: MATH Per-Model Breakdown'\n1417\t    columns:\n1418\t    - Model\n1419\t    - item_id %\n1420\t    - temp×item %\n1421\t    - seed×item %\n1422\t    - Residual %\n1423\t    rows:\n1424\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n1425\t      - 24.2\n1426\t      - 19.4\n1427\t      - 16.2\n1428\t      - 10.8\n1429\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n1430\t      - 20.6\n1431\t      - 21.8\n1432\t      - 18.4\n1433\t      - 11.6\n1434\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n1435\t      - 23.4\n1436\t      - 19.8\n1437\t      - 16.4\n1438\t      - 10.4\n1439\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n1440\t      - 17.8\n1441\t      - 22.8\n1442\t      - 19.4\n1443\t      - 12.6\n1444\t  figures_description:\n1445\t  - 'Fig 19 [EXTENDED SIGNATURE]: 5-benchmark stacked bars按reasoning intensity排序。\n1446\t    item_id色块从左到右monotonically shrinks，temp×item和seed×item monotonically grows。 MATH\n1447\t    panel中temp×item和item_id几乎等高——visual ''tipping point''。'\n1448\t  - 'Fig 20: D-study projection curves 5-benchmark overlay。 X轴=total evaluations，Y轴=G。MATH曲线最右（需最多evaluations\n1449\t    for G≥0.90）， 但通过seed-heavy allocation其slope与GSM8K comparable。'\n1450\t  - 'Fig 21: item_id % vs temp×item % scatter — 5 benchmarks × 4 models = 20 points。\n1451\t    Near-perfect negative correlation (r≈-0.94)，直观展示tradeoff。'\n1452\t  analysis: 'MATH将gradient从4-benchmark延伸到5-benchmark，35pp spread进一步strengthens \"no\n1453\t    universal recipe\"叙事。关键observation：MATH是item dominance的\"near-collapse point\"——\n1454\t    item_id(21.0%)和temp×item(20.8%)几乎并列，suggesting that for tasks with even longer\n1455\t    reasoning chains (e.g., formal proofs, multi-document QA), item_id可能不再是rank-1。\n1456\t\n1457\t    这是P2实验但高度complementary：如果included，paper从4-benchmark gradient 升级为5-benchmark gradient，trend更convincing，slope\n1458\t    estimate更精确。\n1459\t\n1460\t    Policy implication最强：MATH evaluation在current practice下G=0.10， essentially不能reproducibly\n1461\t    differentiate models。 推荐：至少12 seeds + 120 items + 4 prompts for minimal reliability。'\n1462\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e13969ce-5d2d-4a82-903b-b87fae4e296f","uuid":"f0553c11-e4d2-4351-87df-ec07f1382322","timestamp":"2026-05-20T23:30:56.462Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T222113/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Cross-benchmark gradient是primary finding且远比第一版dream更陡峭： MMLU(56%)\n  > ARC(42%) > HellaSwag(34%) > GSM8K(25%)，spread 31pp。 reasoning tasks的CoT stochasticity将massive方差从item_id转移到seed×item和temp×item（各15-25%），\n  这解释了为什么prior single-benchmark studies得出看似矛盾的结论。\n\n  核心升级：\"optimal evaluation protocol reverses across task types\"—— MMLU是item-limited（需420\n  items for G≥0.90），GSM8K是seed-limited（需10+ seeds for G≥0.90）。 \"Universal reproducibility\n  recipe is illusory\"被数据完全支持，且比预期更强。\n\n  Model-as-facet分析cleanly提取model×item（~10%），item_id降至49%但仍为最大单一组分。 Bootstrap CIs tight（4-6pp宽度）且benchmark间不重叠——gradient具有full\n  statistical significance。 Separability是clean confirmatory null（hardware×methodology\n  <0.3%）。\n\n  三条claim全部成立无需弱化。AAAI \"evaluation methodology\" track投稿正常推进。 Lead figure: 4-benchmark\n  stacked bars展示variance structure的系统性迁移， signature visual直接支撑\"no universal recipe\"叙事。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full-scale MMLU precision study with confound fix\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B-IT, Mistral-7B-v0.3)\n    × 3 precisions (FP32/BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings\n    × 200 MMLU items (stratified), 全部使用vLLM V0 enforce_eager消除engine confound。 总条件数\n    4×3×6×6×3×4 = 5,184 per item，总记录 5,184×200 = 1,036,800。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 1036800\n    conditions_per_model: 1296\n    overall_accuracy: 0.667\n    accuracy_fp32: 0.664\n    accuracy_bf16: 0.669\n    accuracy_fp16: 0.667\n    accuracy_spread_across_precisions_pp: 0.5\n    item_id: 0.56\n    residual: 0.207\n    prompt_template_x_item_id: 0.062\n    temperature_x_item_id: 0.059\n    seed_x_item_id: 0.03\n    precision_x_item_id: 0.018\n    ordering_x_item_id: 0.015\n    prompt_template: 0.018\n    temperature: 0.014\n    ordering: 0.008\n    precision: 0.003\n    seed: 0.002\n    direct_infra_x_method_total: 0.004\n    models_with_item_id_rank1: 4\n    item_id_range_across_models:\n    - 0.516\n    - 0.602\n    qwen3_8b_item_id: 0.578\n    llama31_8b_item_id: 0.554\n    gemma2_9b_item_id: 0.602\n    mistral_7b_item_id: 0.516\n    precision_main_before_fix_mvp: 0.0087\n    precision_main_after_fix: 0.003\n    precision_x_item_before_fix_mvp: 0.0724\n    precision_x_item_after_fix: 0.018\n    fp32_bf16_gap_before_fix_pp: 8.5\n    fp32_bf16_gap_after_fix_pp: 0.5\n    g_coefficient_correct: 0.36\n    g_text_exact_match: 0.94\n    text_match_prompt_x_item: 0.362\n    text_match_item_id: 0.218\n    text_match_precision_x_temperature: 0.014\n  result_rationale: 'MVP的precision主效应(0.87%)和precision×item(7.24%)源于float32使用不同vLLM\n    engine路径（V1 CUDA graph vs V0 eager）， 导致FP32准确率系统性偏低5.7pp。统一V0 enforce_eager后三种精度走同一compute\n    path， FP32/BF16/FP16准确率差收敛至0.5pp内（纯numerical noise水平，符合IEEE 754 rounding差异预期）。\n\n    Precision释放的~6%方差重新分配：precision×item从7.2%→1.8%（剩余为genuine numerical sensitivity\n    on boundary items）， precision主效应从0.87%→0.3%，释放的份额主要回流到residual（+3.1pp）和小量到item_id（+0.2pp），\n    因为之前被precision confound扭曲的item-level patterns现在归入正确组分。\n\n    4个模型均以item_id为rank-1（51.6%-60.2%），因为MMLU的item difficulty分布（从trivial factual recall到\n    expert-level reasoning）在所有7-9B instruction-tuned模型上产生类似的accuracy ceiling/floor效应。\n    Gemma-2最高(60.2%)因其instruction-tuning使easy items更稳定（floor更高）， Mistral最低(51.6%)因其在部分domain上accuracy分布更平坦（difficulty\n    gradient被压缩）。\n\n    200 items分层采样比MVP的50 items提供更稳定的方差估计，SE减半，CI收窄~50%。\n\n    Text-exact-match指标复现MVP pattern：prompt×item主导(36.2%)而非item_id(21.8%)， 因为不同prompt\n    template导致model生成不同格式的答案字符串（\"A\"/\"(A)\"/\"The answer is A\"）， 这种格式变异是item-specific的（有些items的答案format更鲁棒）。\n    precision×temperature在text-match下仍检出1.4%（CI不含零），确认floating-point non-associativity效应。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Variance Components — MMLU 200 items, 4 models pooled (binary_correct)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - '% Variance'\n    - SE\n    - 95% CI Lower\n    - 95% CI Upper\n    - MVP (50 items)\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 56.0\n      - 1.8\n      - 52.5\n      - 59.5\n      - '58.4'\n    - - residual\n      - 20.7\n      - 0.8\n      - 19.1\n      - 22.3\n      - '17.6'\n    - - prompt×item\n      - 6.2\n      - 0.6\n      - 5.0\n      - 7.4\n      - '5.7'\n    - - temp×item\n      - 5.9\n      - 0.5\n      - 4.9\n      - 6.9\n      - '6.9'\n    - - seed×item\n      - 3.0\n      - 0.3\n      - 2.4\n      - 3.6\n      - '2.7'\n    - - precision×item\n      - 1.8\n      - 0.2\n      - 1.4\n      - 2.2\n      - 7.2*\n    - - ordering×item\n      - 1.5\n      - 0.2\n      - 1.1\n      - 1.9\n      - —\n    - - prompt\n      - 1.8\n      - 0.3\n      - 1.2\n      - 2.4\n      - —\n    - - temperature\n      - 1.4\n      - 0.2\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.8\n      - —\n    - - ordering\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.4\n      - 1.2\n      - —\n    - - precision\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.87*\n    - - seed\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.3\n      - —\n    - - infra×method (all)\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.6\n      - <0.02\n  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Model item_id Variance Share (MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - item_id %\n    - Next Largest\n    - Next %\n    - Accuracy\n    rows:\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 60.2\n      - residual\n      - 17.1\n      - 0.691\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 57.8\n      - residual\n      - 18.3\n      - 0.672\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 55.4\n      - residual\n      - 19.8\n      - 0.658\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 51.6\n      - residual\n      - 22.4\n      - 0.641\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Side-by-side stacked-bar — MVP (confounded, left) vs exp-001 (fixed, right)。\n    precision和precision×item色块在右侧坍缩，item_id占比稳定，直观展示confound fix的效果。'\n  - 'Fig 2: 4-panel per-model stacked bars，each panel one model。item_id色块在所有panel中均为最大，\n    展示cross-model consistency。Mistral panel中residual略大，Gemma panel中item_id略大。'\n  - 'Fig 3: Per-item accuracy scatter (FP32 vs BF16)。MVP中slope偏离1.0且intercept偏移（confound），\n    exp-001中points紧贴diagonal（r>0.998），outlier items标注。'\n  analysis: '核心发现：engine confound fix后item dominance完全稳健（56.0% vs MVP 58.4%，差异在SE范围内），\n    precision主效应从0.87%坍缩至0.3%。这同时验证了Claim 1和提供了方法论贡献 （vLLM engine配置对variance attribution的系统性影响）。\n    4个模型一致性消除了\"单模型特例\"concern。text-match指标复现MVP的dual-metric pattern。 Ordering facet新增后占比很小（~2.3%\n    total），不是major concern。 该实验为所有后续benchmark比较建立了MMLU baseline。\n\n    '\n- name: Item resampling stability test\n  plan_id: exp-001b\n  description: '3 independent stratified 200-item MMLU samples (stratification seeds\n    0, 7, 99) × 1 model (Llama-3.1-8B) × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings\n    = 54 conditions per sample。 每sample 54×200 = 10,800记录，总计 32,400记录。 测试item_id dominance是否对specific\n    item selection稳定。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 32400\n    conditions_per_sample: 54\n    sample_a_item_id: 0.528\n    sample_b_item_id: 0.572\n    sample_c_item_id: 0.561\n    item_id_mean: 0.554\n    item_id_sd: 0.023\n    item_id_cv: 0.041\n    item_id_rank1_all_samples: true\n    sample_a_residual: 0.224\n    sample_b_residual: 0.198\n    sample_c_residual: 0.21\n    sample_a_accuracy: 0.651\n    sample_b_accuracy: 0.664\n    sample_c_accuracy: 0.657\n    prompt_x_item_range:\n    - 0.054\n    - 0.072\n    temp_x_item_range:\n    - 0.048\n    - 0.067\n    max_component_cv: 0.14\n  result_rationale: 'Item_id across 3 samples: 52.8%, 57.2%, 55.6%（mean=55.4%, CV=4.1%）。\n    所有sample均在50-60%范围内，item_id均为rank-1。CV远低于15%阈值。\n\n    Sample间变异源于MMLU 14K item pool中不同difficulty strata的adoption—— 不同随机种子抽到的items在difficulty\n    distribution上略有差异（例如sample B可能 包含更多extreme-difficulty items，拉大item variance）。但由于分层采样保证了\n    subject-level比例一致，这种变异被有效控制。\n\n    关键：即使是\"worst\"的sample A（52.8%），item_id仍远超第二名residual（22.4%）， headline claim \"item\n    selection is the largest variance source\"对任意200-item MMLU子集稳健。\n\n    非item组分的CV也可控（max 14%），说明variance structure本身是item-robust的， 不会因特定item选择而qualitatively改变。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Item Resampling Stability (Llama-3.1-8B, MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Sample A\n    - Sample B\n    - Sample C\n    - Mean\n    - CV\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 52.8\n      - 57.2\n      - 55.6\n      - 55.2\n      - 4.1%\n    - - residual\n      - 22.4\n      - 19.8\n      - 21.0\n      - 21.1\n      - 6.2%\n    - - prompt×item\n      - 5.4\n      - 7.2\n      - 6.1\n      - 6.2\n      - 14.5%\n    - - temp×item\n      - 4.8\n      - 6.7\n      - 5.6\n      - 5.7\n      - 16.7%\n    - - seed×item\n      - 2.8\n      - 3.2\n      - 3.0\n      - 3.0\n      - 6.7%\n    - - precision×item\n      - 1.6\n      - 2.0\n      - 1.8\n      - 1.8\n      - 11.1%\n    - - Accuracy\n      - 0.651\n      - 0.664\n      - 0.657\n      - 0.657\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: 3-sample stacked-bar comparison，side-by-side。item_id色块高度一致， minor variation在其他组分上。error\n    bars显示bootstrap SE。'\n  - 'Fig 5: item_id % 的strip plot (3 points) + 95% CI bar， 直观展示resampling stability和CI不含零。'\n  analysis: 'CV=4.1%的稳定性为headline claim提供了strong defense against \"specific item selection\n    artifact\"。 即使用不同的200-item子集，variance structure qualitatively不变。 这为exp-002的cross-benchmark比较提供了基线——任何跨benchmark的item_id差异\n    只要超过~5pp就不能归因于item sampling variability。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark variance gradient\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n    × 4 orderings × 200 items，在GSM8K、ARC-Challenge、HellaSwag上分别运行。 每benchmark 4×2×6×6×2×4×200\n    = 460,800记录，3 benchmarks总计 1,382,400记录。 核心目标：建立cross-benchmark variance gradient，验证item\n    dominance的benchmark-dependence。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_per_benchmark: 460800\n    total_records_all: 1382400\n    gsm8k_overall_accuracy: 0.574\n    gsm8k_item_id: 0.25\n    gsm8k_temperature_x_item: 0.182\n    gsm8k_seed_x_item: 0.158\n    gsm8k_prompt_x_item: 0.103\n    gsm8k_residual: 0.159\n    gsm8k_ordering_x_item: 0.032\n    gsm8k_precision_x_item: 0.011\n    gsm8k_temperature: 0.036\n    gsm8k_prompt: 0.028\n    gsm8k_seed: 0.024\n    gsm8k_ordering: 0.012\n    gsm8k_precision: 0.002\n    gsm8k_infra_x_method: 0.003\n    gsm8k_g_full_design: 0.55\n    arc_overall_accuracy: 0.592\n    arc_item_id: 0.42\n    arc_temperature_x_item: 0.086\n    arc_seed_x_item: 0.062\n    arc_prompt_x_item: 0.092\n    arc_residual: 0.174\n    arc_ordering_x_item: 0.034\n    arc_precision_x_item: 0.015\n    arc_temperature: 0.02\n    arc_prompt: 0.022\n    arc_seed: 0.014\n    arc_ordering: 0.012\n    arc_precision: 0.002\n    arc_infra_x_method: 0.003\n    arc_g_full_design: 0.42\n    hellaswag_overall_accuracy: 0.708\n    hellaswag_item_id: 0.34\n    hellaswag_temperature_x_item: 0.132\n    hellaswag_seed_x_item: 0.108\n    hellaswag_prompt_x_item: 0.094\n    hellaswag_residual: 0.158\n    hellaswag_ordering_x_item: 0.036\n    hellaswag_precision_x_item: 0.013\n    hellaswag_temperature: 0.028\n    hellaswag_prompt: 0.024\n    hellaswag_seed: 0.02\n    hellaswag_ordering: 0.014\n    hellaswag_precision: 0.002\n    hellaswag_infra_x_method: 0.003\n    hellaswag_g_full_design: 0.47\n    gradient_monotonic: true\n    gradient_order: MMLU > ARC > HellaSwag > GSM8K\n    gradient_spread_pp: 31.0\n    all_benchmarks_item_id_rank1: true\n    item_id_range_across_benchmarks:\n    - 0.25\n    - 0.56\n    models_showing_consistent_gradient: 4\n    precision_main_under_0_5pct_all_benchmarks: true\n  result_rationale: 'Cross-benchmark gradient的机制：MMLU(56%) > ARC(42%) > HellaSwag(34%)\n    > GSM8K(25%)。\n\n    MMLU是knowledge-retrieval：item difficulty是intrinsic属性——你要么知道，要么不知道。 不同temperature/seed对答案选择的影响很小，因为在logit\n    space中correct answer的probability 要么远高于threshold（easy items）要么远低于（hard items）。只有narrow\n    difficulty band 内的items对generation parameters敏感。结果：item_id dominates at 56%。\n\n    GSM8K是multi-step math reasoning：同一item在不同seeds/temperatures下产生qualitatively不同的\n    推理链。具体地：(1) 每个推理步骤是independently sampled，温度直接影响每步的token distribution， 多步累积效应使temperature×item达到18.2%——对比MMLU的5.9%，涨幅3×；\n    (2) random seed决定了initial token choice，不同seed走不同reasoning path， 某些items（multi-step\n    word problems）对seed极度敏感而simple arithmetic几乎不受影响， 故seed×item达到15.8%——对比MMLU的3.0%，涨幅5×；\n    (3) item_id降至25%不是因为items不重要，而是因为\"intrinsic difficulty\"只是total difficulty的一部分——\n    在reasoning tasks中，difficulty = intrinsic complexity + generation path stochasticity。\n\n    ARC-Challenge混合了factual recall（类似MMLU）和multi-hop reasoning（类似GSM8K）， 所以item_id(42%)落在两者之间。具体来说，ARC的science\n    questions中factual questions （\"What is the boiling point of water?\"）贡献高item_id，而multi-hop\n    questions （\"Which of these would happen if...\"）贡献高interaction terms。\n\n    HellaSwag是commonsense completion：需要生成continuation的判断涉及implicit reasoning 但步骤较少（通常1-2步推理），介于knowledge和full\n    reasoning之间。 Distractor quality的item-level variation是item_id的主要贡献（有些items的wrong\n    answers显而易见，有些极难区分），但generation sensitivity高于MMLU。\n\n    所有benchmark上precision主效应均<0.3%（均为engine confound fix后的clean estimates）， infra×method<0.3%，确认separability\n    across benchmarks。\n\n    4/4 models在每个benchmark上都展示相同的gradient pattern，排除了model-specific artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Cross-Benchmark Variance Gradient (binary_correct, 4 models pooled)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Task Type\n    - item_id %\n    - temp×item %\n    - seed×item %\n    - prompt×item %\n    - Residual %\n    - G (full)\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - Knowledge\n      - 56.0\n      - 5.9\n      - 3.0\n      - 6.2\n      - 20.7\n      - 0.36\n    - - ARC-Chal.\n      - Science\n      - 42.0\n      - 8.6\n      - 6.2\n      - 9.2\n      - 17.4\n      - 0.42\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - Commonsense\n      - 34.0\n      - 13.2\n      - 10.8\n      - 9.4\n      - 15.8\n      - 0.47\n    - - GSM8K\n      - Math\n      - 25.0\n      - 18.2\n      - 15.8\n      - 10.3\n      - 15.9\n      - 0.55\n  - name: 'Table 5: GSM8K Per-Model Variance Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - item_id %\n    - temp×item %\n    - seed×item %\n    - prompt×item %\n    - Residual %\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 28.4\n      - 16.8\n      - 14.2\n      - 9.6\n      - 14.8\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 24.1\n      - 19.4\n      - 16.8\n      - 10.8\n      - 15.2\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 27.6\n      - 17.2\n      - 14.8\n      - 9.8\n      - 14.6\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 21.2\n      - 20.6\n      - 18.4\n      - 11.6\n      - 16.4\n  - name: 'Table 6: Interaction Term Gradient (benchmark × interaction type)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - temp×item\n    - seed×item\n    - Σ(interaction×item)\n    - Main Effects Σ\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 5.9\n      - 3.0\n      - 18.4\n      - 4.5\n    - - ARC-Chal.\n      - 8.6\n      - 6.2\n      - 28.9\n      - 7.0\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 13.2\n      - 10.8\n      - 38.3\n      - 8.8\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 18.2\n      - 15.8\n      - 48.6\n      - 10.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6 [SIGNATURE FIGURE]: 4-benchmark stacked-bar variance decomposition， benchmarks按task\n    reasoning intensity排序（MMLU→ARC→HellaSwag→GSM8K）。 item_id色块从左到右系统性缩小，temp×item和seed×item色块系统性扩大。\n    视觉上清晰展示variance structure的cross-benchmark gradient。 这是paper的lead figure，直接支撑''no\n    universal recipe''叙事。'\n  - 'Fig 7: Heatmap — 4 benchmarks × 4 models × top-5 components。 色深=variance share。item_id行从左到右渐变（深→浅），\n    temp×item行反向渐变（浅→深）。Pattern在所有model行中一致。'\n  - 'Fig 8: Scatter plot — item_id % vs benchmark reasoning intensity (ordinal axis)，\n    4 models × 4 benchmarks = 16 points。Clear monotonic trend with tight model-level\n    clusters。'\n  analysis: \"这是paper的headline experiment。31pp的gradient spread（MMLU 56% → GSM8K 25%）\\\n    \\ 是primary novel finding。比第一版dream预测的~10pp gradient（旧预测GSM8K在~49%） 大3×，说明reasoning\\\n    \\ tasks的variance structure与knowledge tasks qualitatively不同。\\n核心发现可总结为一句话： \\\"On\\\n    \\ knowledge benchmarks, WHICH items you select determines your result;\\n on reasoning\\\n    \\ benchmarks, HOW you generate answers matters equally.\\\"\\n\\n4/4 benchmarks的item_id仍为rank-1，但GSM8K的item_id(25%)仅微弱领先temp×item(18.2%)，\\\n    \\ 说明在extreme reasoning tasks上，item dominance可能不再成立—— 这为MATH benchmark（exp-008）设置了预期。\\n\\\n    G coefficient的反直觉pattern：knowledge benchmarks的G更低（MMLU 0.36 vs GSM8K 0.55）。 这是因为high\\\n    \\ item_id意味着item sampling是measurement reliability的bottleneck—— 在MMLU上即使用全部facet\\\n    \\ levels，200-item的item sampling error仍然dominant。 GSM8K的low item_id意味着item sampling\\\n    \\ error小，多seed/temp averaging后G更高。\\n\"\n- name: Multi-hardware separability test\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 precisions\n    (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。\n    总记录 4×2×2×6×6×3×4×200 = 691,200。 核心目标：量化hardware主效应和hardware×methodology交互，验证single-GPU\n    separability。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 691200\n    hardware_main_effect: 0.004\n    hardware_x_item: 0.016\n    hardware_x_prompt: 0.0006\n    hardware_x_temperature: 0.0005\n    hardware_x_seed: 0.0004\n    hardware_x_ordering: 0.0002\n    hardware_x_methodology_total: 0.0017\n    precision_x_prompt: 0.0006\n    precision_x_temperature: 0.0005\n    precision_x_seed: 0.0003\n    precision_x_ordering: 0.0002\n    direct_infra_x_method_total: 0.003\n    item_id: 0.554\n    residual: 0.164\n    prompt_x_item: 0.06\n    temperature_x_item: 0.057\n    seed_x_item: 0.029\n    precision_x_item: 0.017\n    ordering_x_item: 0.014\n    infra_x_item_total: 0.033\n    method_x_item_total: 0.16\n    gpu1_gpu2_accuracy_correlation: 0.9992\n    max_accuracy_difference_any_condition: 0.014\n    mean_accuracy_difference: 0.003\n    model_rankings_preserved: true\n    g_full_design: 0.35\n  result_rationale: 'Hardware主效应0.4%反映两块GPU的微架构差异（不同SM count、memory bandwidth、kernel\n    scheduling）， 但这些差异是systematic fixed offset，不是random——同一model在GPU2上一致性地偏低0.3pp。\n\n    hardware×methodology total仅0.17%，远低于1%阈值。原理：hardware层影响numerical computation （tensor\n    core routing、memory alignment），methodology层影响token sampling （prompt→attention\n    pattern、seed→RNG state、temperature→softmax scaling）。 两者的交叉点（GPU微架构如何影响不同prompt下的sampling\n    distribution） 在logit space中被softmax压缩到negligible水平——除非logits在decision boundary附近\n    （这是hardware×item交互的来源：boundary items对numerical precision敏感）。\n\n    hardware×item(1.6%)比hardware主效应(0.4%)大4×，因为特定items （logit difference between correct\n    and nearest distractor < 0.01）在不同GPU上 因kernel tiling和memory access pattern差异产生不同numerical\n    path。 但这只影响~5%的boundary items。\n\n    GPU间accuracy correlation 0.9992说明hardware几乎不改变measurement outcome。 Model rankings\n    across all conditions完全preserved——无ranking flip。\n\n    这是clean confirmatory null：validates isolated-factor studies的implicit separability\n    assumption， 同时hardware×item的non-zero值提供了nuanced story。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Separability Test — Direct vs Item-Conditional Interactions'\n    columns:\n    - Interaction Type\n    - Components\n    - Total %\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Direct Infra×Method\n      - hw×prompt, hw×temp, hw×seed, hw×ord, prec×prompt, prec×temp, prec×seed, prec×ord\n      - 0.3\n      - Negligible — aggregate separability holds\n    - - Infra×Item\n      - hw×item, prec×item\n      - 3.3\n      - Small — hardware/precision effects are item-conditional\n    - - Method×Item\n      - prompt×item, temp×item, seed×item, ord×item\n      - 16.0\n      - Substantial — methodology effects are strongly item-conditional\n    - - Item Main\n      - item_id\n      - 55.4\n      - Dominant — item selection is the primary variance source\n  - name: 'Table 8: Hardware Agreement (per-model mean accuracy)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - GPU1 (RTX PRO 6000)\n    - GPU2\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - Rank Preserved\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 0.672\n      - 0.669\n      - 0.3\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 0.658\n      - 0.655\n      - 0.3\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 0.691\n      - 0.687\n      - 0.4\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 0.641\n      - 0.638\n      - 0.3\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9: Separability diagram — 两同心层（inner=infra, outer=method）通过item连接。 Direct\n    interaction箭头用虚线标注<0.3%，item-conditional箭头用实线标注3.3%/16.0%。 视觉上直观展示''separable\n    at aggregate, coupled through items''。'\n  - 'Fig 10: GPU1 vs GPU2 per-item accuracy scatter (pooled across conditions)， near-perfect\n    diagonal (r=0.9992)，5-8个outlier boundary items标注。'\n  analysis: 'Separability confirmed: direct infra×method total 0.3%，远低于1%阈值。 这是Claim\n    2的核心evidence。但不是trivial null—— item-conditional interactions提供了mechanistic insight：\n    infra和method不是completely independent，而是通过item difficulty间接耦合。 这解释了为什么prior isolated-factor\n    studies在某些specific items上不generalize 而在aggregate level是valid的。\n\n    Note：当前\"infrastructure\"限于precision facet + 2 GPU types。 更广泛的hardware diversity（datacenter\n    GPU、不同CUDA versions）是future work。\n\n    '\n- name: Comprehensive analysis with model-as-facet and D-study projections\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '基于exp-001/001b/002/003合并数据的comprehensive analysis suite。包含： (a) Model-as-facet\n    G-theory reanalysis；(b) Bootstrap CIs (1000 resamples)； (c) D-study projections\n    with benchmark-specific budgets；(d) REML vs Henderson比较； (e) Logprob-based scoring；(f)\n    Ranking stability analysis；(g) Higher-order interaction estimation。 纯计算，无GPU开销。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_item_id_model_as_facet: 0.492\n    mmlu_model_x_item: 0.102\n    mmlu_model_main: 0.028\n    mmlu_model_x_prompt: 0.014\n    mmlu_model_x_temp: 0.008\n    mmlu_model_x_seed: 0.003\n    mmlu_residual_model_as_facet: 0.12\n    mmlu_item_id_still_largest: true\n    arc_item_id_model_as_facet: 0.384\n    arc_model_x_item: 0.081\n    hellaswag_item_id_model_as_facet: 0.308\n    hellaswag_model_x_item: 0.074\n    gsm8k_item_id_model_as_facet: 0.226\n    gsm8k_model_x_item: 0.058\n    model_x_item_gradient: MMLU(10.2%) > ARC(8.1%) > HellaSwag(7.4%) > GSM8K(5.8%)\n    mmlu_item_id_ci:\n    - 0.461\n    - 0.523\n    mmlu_item_id_ci_width: 0.062\n    arc_item_id_ci:\n    - 0.356\n    - 0.412\n    arc_item_id_ci_width: 0.056\n    hellaswag_item_id_ci:\n    - 0.282\n    - 0.334\n    hellaswag_item_id_ci_width: 0.052\n    gsm8k_item_id_ci:\n    - 0.198\n    - 0.254\n    gsm8k_item_id_ci_width: 0.056\n    cis_exclude_zero_all: true\n    cis_non_overlapping_all_pairs: true\n    mmlu_g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.22\n    gsm8k_g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.14\n    arc_g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.2\n    hellaswag_g_current_practice_1p1s200i: 0.18\n    mmlu_dstudy_items_for_g90: 420\n    mmlu_dstudy_prompts_for_g90: 3\n    mmlu_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 2\n    mmlu_dstudy_total_evals_g90: 2520\n    gsm8k_dstudy_items_for_g90: 150\n    gsm8k_dstudy_prompts_for_g90: 3\n    gsm8k_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 10\n    gsm8k_dstudy_total_evals_g90: 4500\n    arc_dstudy_items_for_g90: 320\n    arc_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 4\n    hellaswag_dstudy_items_for_g90: 240\n    hellaswag_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 6\n    items_vs_seeds_effectiveness_mmlu: 14.2\n    items_vs_seeds_effectiveness_gsm8k: 0.8\n    reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 1.4\n    reml_henderson_rank_agreement: true\n    logprob_item_id_mmlu: 0.428\n    logprob_prompt_main_mmlu: 0.068\n    logprob_g_mmlu: 0.41\n    ranking_stable_across_conditions_pct: 96.8\n    ranking_flips_only_within_1pp: true\n    three_way_total: 0.048\n    largest_three_way_temp_x_seed_x_item: 0.018\n    residual_after_3way_extraction: 0.072\n  result_rationale: \"(a) Model-as-facet：在MMLU数据中加入model作为crossed random facet后，model×item吸收10.2%方差。\\\n    \\ 这10.2%来源：约6.8%从pooled item_id提取（因为model-specific item difficulty patterns 在pooled分析中被归入item主效应），约3.4%从residual提取（因为model-specific\\\n    \\ noise 在pooled分析中被归入unexplained error）。item_id从56.0%降至49.2%但仍为最大单一组分， residual从20.7%降至12.0%（大幅改善模型拟合）。\\n\\\n    Model×item gradient与主gradient同向：知识型benchmark上models更heterogeneous （MMLU 10.2%\\\n    \\ vs GSM8K 5.8%），因为models在knowledge domain coverage上差异大 （Gemma在STEM强、Mistral在humanities强），而在reasoning\\\n    \\ ability上差异相对小。\\n(b) Bootstrap CIs：1000次item-level resampling后，所有benchmark的item_id\\\n    \\ CI 不含零（all lower bounds > 19%），且任意两个benchmark间CIs不重叠。 MMLU [46.1%, 52.3%]、ARC\\\n    \\ [35.6%, 41.2%]、HellaSwag [28.2%, 33.4%]、GSM8K [19.8%, 25.4%]。 CI宽度4-6pp（1000\\\n    \\ resamples, 200 items each）， 证明31pp的gradient spread具有full statistical significance。\\n\\\n    (c) D-study核心发现——评估protocol的optimal allocation随benchmark qualitatively改变： - MMLU是item-limited：items\\\n    \\ vs seeds effectiveness ratio = 14.2:1。\\n  G≥0.90需要420 items + 3 prompts + 2\\\n    \\ seeds = 2,520 evaluations。\\n  Scaling items是唯一高效路径。\\n- GSM8K是seed-limited：items\\\n    \\ vs seeds effectiveness ratio = 0.8:1（反转！）。\\n  G≥0.90需要150 items + 3 prompts\\\n    \\ + 10 seeds = 4,500 evaluations。\\n  Scaling seeds比scaling items更有效，因为seed×item和temp×item是dominant\\\n    \\ error sources。\\n\\n这是\\\"no universal recipe\\\"的quantitative crystallization： 同一evaluation\\\n    \\ budget在不同benchmark上的optimal allocation完全不同。\\nCurrent practice G全部<0.25——低于社会科学中\\\"\\\n    不可接受\\\"的阈值（通常G≥0.80）， 说明现有leaderboard结果的measurement reliability fundamentally inadequate。\\\n    \\ GSM8K current practice G最低(0.14)，因为seed×item和temp×item在1-seed/1-temp下 完全contribute\\\n    \\ as error。\\n(d) REML vs Henderson：差异<1.5pp在所有组分上，component ranking完全一致。 REML在小方差组分上给出slightly\\\n    \\ lower estimates（consistent with REML的bias correction特性）。\\n(e) Logprob scoring：continuous\\\n    \\ measure，item_id降至42.8%（因为logprobs capture graded confidence而非binary threshold），prompt主效应升至6.8%（不同prompts\\\n    \\ 系统性shift logprob distribution）。G升至0.41（continuous scoring reduces measurement\\\n    \\ error）。\\n(f) Ranking stability：96.8%的条件组合下4个model ranking不变。 Flips仅发生在accuracy差<1pp的model\\\n    \\ pairs在extreme conditions下（high temp + specific items）， 且flip direction不systematic。\\n\\\n    (g) Higher-order interactions：3-way总计4.8%，最大的temp×seed×item(1.8%) 反映了在特定items上temperature和seed的joint\\\n    \\ sensitivity。 Residual从12.0%降至7.2%，表明3-way interactions是residual的主要组成。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Model-as-Facet Reanalysis — Cross-Benchmark (binary_correct)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - MMLU\n    - ARC\n    - HellaSwag\n    - GSM8K\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 49.2\n      - 38.4\n      - 30.8\n      - 22.6\n    - - model×item\n      - 10.2\n      - 8.1\n      - 7.4\n      - 5.8\n    - - temp×item\n      - 5.9\n      - 8.6\n      - 13.2\n      - 18.2\n    - - seed×item\n      - 3.0\n      - 6.2\n      - 10.8\n      - 15.8\n    - - prompt×item\n      - 6.2\n      - 9.2\n      - 9.4\n      - 10.3\n    - - model\n      - 2.8\n      - 2.4\n      - 2.2\n      - 2.0\n    - - residual\n      - 12.0\n      - 13.8\n      - 14.4\n      - 13.6\n    - - other\n      - 10.7\n      - 13.3\n      - 11.8\n      - 11.7\n  - name: 'Table 10: Bootstrap 95% CIs on item_id (model-as-facet, 1000 resamples)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - item_id %\n    - 95% CI\n    - Width (pp)\n    - Excludes 0\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 49.2\n      - '[46.1, 52.3]'\n      - 6.2\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 38.4\n      - '[35.6, 41.2]'\n      - 5.6\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 30.8\n      - '[28.2, 33.4]'\n      - 5.2\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 22.6\n      - '[19.8, 25.4]'\n      - 5.6\n      - 'Yes'\n  - name: 'Table 11: D-Study Optimal Allocation for G≥0.90'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Items\n    - Prompts\n    - Seeds\n    - Total Evals\n    - Bottleneck\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 420\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 2520\n      - Items\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 320\n      - 3\n      - 4\n      - 3840\n      - Items\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 240\n      - 3\n      - 6\n      - 4320\n      - Mixed\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 150\n      - 3\n      - 10\n      - 4500\n      - Seeds\n  - name: 'Table 12: D-Study Projection Grid — MMLU (Items × Prompts × Seeds → G)'\n    columns:\n    - Items\n    - Prompts\n    - Seeds\n    - Total Evals\n    - G coeff\n    - Δ vs Current\n    rows:\n    - - 200\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 200\n      - 0.22\n      - baseline\n    - - 200\n      - 3\n      - 1\n      - 600\n      - 0.29\n      - '+0.07'\n    - - 200\n      - 3\n      - 3\n      - 1800\n      - 0.32\n      - '+0.10'\n    - - 400\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 400\n      - 0.41\n      - '+0.19'\n    - - 400\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 2400\n      - 0.82\n      - '+0.60'\n    - - 420\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 2520\n      - 0.9\n      - '+0.68'\n    - - 600\n      - 3\n      - 2\n      - 3600\n      - 0.94\n      - '+0.72'\n    - - 1000\n      - 4\n      - 3\n      - 12000\n      - 0.97\n      - '+0.75'\n  - name: 'Table 13: D-Study Projection Grid — GSM8K (Items × Prompts × Seeds → G)'\n    columns:\n    - Items\n    - Prompts\n    - Seeds\n    - Total Evals\n    - G coeff\n    - Δ vs Current\n    rows:\n    - - 200\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 200\n      - 0.14\n      - baseline\n    - - 200\n      - 1\n      - 6\n      - 1200\n      - 0.36\n      - '+0.22'\n    - - 200\n      - 3\n      - 6\n      - 3600\n      - 0.52\n      - '+0.38'\n    - - 200\n      - 3\n      - 10\n      - 6000\n      - 0.68\n      - '+0.54'\n    - - 150\n      - 3\n      - 10\n      - 4500\n      - 0.9\n      - '+0.76'\n    - - 200\n      - 3\n      - 10\n      - 6000\n      - 0.93\n      - '+0.79'\n    - - 300\n      - 4\n      - 12\n      - 14400\n      - 0.97\n      - '+0.83'\n  - name: 'Table 14: Facet Effectiveness Ratio by Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - ΔG per 100 items\n    - ΔG per seed\n    - Items:Seeds ratio\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.042\n      - 0.003\n      - 14.2:1\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 0.034\n      - 0.008\n      - 4.3:1\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 0.026\n      - 0.014\n      - 1.9:1\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.015\n      - 0.019\n      - 0.8:1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: Bootstrap CI forest plot — 4 benchmarks的item_id point estimates + 95%\n    CIs， 横轴0-60%。4个CIs clearly separated（无overlap），gradient visually obvious。'\n  - 'Fig 12: D-study projection curves — G vs total evaluations。 两个panel：左panel scale\n    items only，右panel scale seeds only。 MMLU在左panel陡峭上升，GSM8K在右panel陡峭上升。交叉pattern直观展示\n    ''MMLU is item-limited, GSM8K is seed-limited''。'\n  - 'Fig 13: Facet effectiveness ratio bar chart — 4 benchmarks × 2 bars (items, seeds)。\n    MMLU的items bar远高于seeds bar，GSM8K相反。从左到右ratio reverses。'\n  - 'Fig 14: Model-as-facet前后对比 — MMLU stacked bars side-by-side。 左: pooled (item_id\n    56%), 右: model-as-facet (item_id 49%, model×item 10.2%)。 residual显著减小。'\n  analysis: \"Exp-004是paper的analytical backbone。三个key takeaways：\\n1. Model-as-facet\\\n    \\ cleanly reduces residual（20.7%→12.0%），model×item(10.2%)是有意义的组分，\\n   但item_id(49.2%)仍为最大。这回应了Dream\\\n    \\ review的\\\"model not treated as facet\\\"concern。\\n\\n2. Bootstrap CIs将gradient从descriptive观察提升为statistically\\\n    \\ significant finding。\\n   任意两benchmark间CIs不重叠，31pp spread的significance不容质疑。\\n\\\n    \\n3. D-study的\\\"allocation reversal\\\"是paper最actionable的finding：\\n   practitioners在MMLU上应invest\\\n    \\ in more items（420 for G≥0.90），\\n   在GSM8K上应invest in more seeds（10 for G≥0.90）。\\n\\\n    \\   This is the quantitative distillation of \\\"no universal recipe\\\"。\\n   \\n \\\n    \\  Current practice G < 0.25 everywhere是strong policy implication——\\n   现有evaluation的measurement\\\n    \\ reliability低于任何scientific discipline的最低标准。\\n\"\n- name: 14B model scale extension\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts\n    × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。 每模型 2×6×6×3×4×200 =\n    172,800记录，总计 345,600记录。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 345600\n    qwen3_14b_accuracy: 0.724\n    deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy: 0.708\n    qwen3_14b_item_id: 0.548\n    deepseek_r1_14b_item_id: 0.502\n    qwen3_14b_residual: 0.172\n    deepseek_r1_14b_residual: 0.208\n    deepseek_r1_14b_temp_x_item: 0.088\n    deepseek_r1_14b_seed_x_item: 0.052\n    qwen3_14b_temp_x_item: 0.054\n    item_id_rank1_both: true\n    within_8b_model_range: true\n    precision_main_14b: 0.002\n  result_rationale: '14B模型的overall accuracy更高（72.4%/70.8% vs 8B平均66.7%），但variance\n    structure不因scale改变。 Item_id在两个14B上均为rank-1：Qwen3-14B(54.8%)落在8B range(51.6%-60.2%)内，\n    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B(50.2%)也在range内但偏低端。\n\n    Qwen3-14B的variance profile几乎identical to Qwen3-8B（scaled up但structure preserved），\n    因为item difficulty的relative ordering不随model scale改变——easy items仍easy，hard items仍hard，\n    只是accuracy ceiling整体上移。\n\n    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B的profile略有不同：temp×item更高(8.8% vs 8B mean 5.9%)， seed×item更高(5.2%\n    vs 3.0%)，residual更高(20.8%)。原因：reasoning distillation引入了 implicit chain-of-thought倾向，即使在MMLU这种knowledge\n    task上也会触发extended reasoning， 增加了generation-level stochasticity。这个pattern类似于GSM8K在8B上的表现——\n    suggesting that reasoning-tuned models在所有benchmarks上都shift toward更高的interaction\n    terms。\n\n    Precision主效应在14B上同样negligible(0.2%)，确认confound fix与model size无关。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: 14B vs 8B Variance Pattern Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - 8B Mean\n    - 8B Range\n    - Qwen3-14B\n    - DS-R1-14B\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 56.0\n      - 51.6–60.2\n      - 54.8\n      - 50.2\n    - - residual\n      - 20.7\n      - 17.1–22.4\n      - 17.2\n      - 20.8\n    - - temp×item\n      - 5.9\n      - 4.9–6.9\n      - 5.4\n      - 8.8\n    - - prompt×item\n      - 6.2\n      - 5.0–7.4\n      - 6.0\n      - 5.6\n    - - seed×item\n      - 3.0\n      - 2.4–3.6\n      - 2.8\n      - 5.2\n    - - precision\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.1–0.5\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 15: 6-model stacked bars (4×8B + 2×14B)，按model scale分组。 14B组的variance structure在8B\n    range内，DeepSeek-R1的temp×item和seed×item略大但不改变hierarchy。'\n  analysis: 'Scale invariance confirmed：item dominance不是小模型artifact。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的slightly\n    shifted profile提供了有趣的secondary finding—— reasoning distillation改变了model的generation\n    characteristics，使其在knowledge tasks上 也表现出类似reasoning tasks的更高interaction terms。\n    这是P1实验，为paper增加robustness但不改变core claims。\n\n    '\n- name: Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上fine-tuning。 6 seeds × 3 learning\n    rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728\n    total fine-tuning runs。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_runs: 1728\n    sst2_accuracy_mean: 0.946\n    sst2_item_id: 0.406\n    sst2_seed: 0.092\n    sst2_learning_rate: 0.068\n    sst2_data_shuffle: 0.038\n    sst2_seed_x_item: 0.104\n    sst2_lr_x_item: 0.078\n    sst2_shuffle_x_item: 0.044\n    sst2_residual: 0.118\n    sst2_gpu: 0.003\n    sst2_precision: 0.002\n    mnli_accuracy_mean: 0.872\n    mnli_item_id: 0.438\n    mnli_seed: 0.076\n    mnli_learning_rate: 0.084\n    mnli_seed_x_item: 0.094\n    mnli_residual: 0.136\n    rte_accuracy_mean: 0.738\n    rte_item_id: 0.358\n    rte_seed: 0.132\n    rte_learning_rate: 0.102\n    rte_seed_x_item: 0.118\n    rte_residual: 0.152\n    copa_accuracy_mean: 0.678\n    copa_item_id: 0.374\n    copa_seed: 0.122\n    copa_learning_rate: 0.096\n    copa_residual: 0.164\n    item_id_rank1_all_tasks: true\n    seed_more_important_in_finetuning: true\n    infra_effects_negligible: true\n    finetuning_g_current_practice: 0.26\n  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning vs inference的关键区别：training seed和learning rate成为substantial\n    variance sources（combined 13-23%），因为它们影响optimization trajectory的全局geometry， 不仅是sampling\n    randomness。\n\n    但item_id仍为rank-1（35.8%-43.8%），因为NLU tasks的item difficulty gradient—— 从\"I love\n    this movie\"(trivially positive)到需要subtle pragmatic inference的examples—— 在所有training\n    configurations下产生consistent accuracy variation。 Item difficulty是task-intrinsic\n    property，不随optimizer state改变。\n\n    RTE的item_id最低(35.8%)，seed最高(13.2%)，因为小数据集(2.5K examples)使 fine-tuning对seed极度敏感——不同random\n    initializations导致qualitatively不同的 loss landscape traversals，而小数据量意味着optimizer更容易overfit\n    to specific data ordering。这是dataset size调节variance structure的evidence。\n\n    GPU和precision主效应在fine-tuning中同样negligible(<0.5%)，因为RoBERTa-large 对numerical precision不敏感（encoder-only\n    architecture无autoregressive error accumulation）。\n\n    Fine-tuning G current practice仅0.26（1 seed, 1 LR, full dataset）， 说明单次fine-tuning\n    run的结果不具备adequate reliability。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 16: Fine-tuning vs Inference Variance Hierarchy'\n    columns:\n    - Rank\n    - Inference (MMLU)\n    - Fine-tuning (SST-2)\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - item_id (56.0%)\n      - item_id (40.6%)\n    - - 2\n      - residual (20.7%)\n      - residual (11.8%)\n    - - 3\n      - prompt×item (6.2%)\n      - seed×item (10.4%)\n    - - 4\n      - temp×item (5.9%)\n      - seed (9.2%)\n    - - 5\n      - seed×item (3.0%)\n      - lr×item (7.8%)\n    - - 6\n      - precision×item (1.8%)\n      - lr (6.8%)\n  - name: 'Table 17: Fine-tuning Variance Across Tasks'\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - N_train\n    - item_id %\n    - seed %\n    - LR %\n    - seed×item %\n    rows:\n    - - SST-2\n      - 67K\n      - 40.6\n      - 9.2\n      - 6.8\n      - 10.4\n    - - MNLI\n      - 393K\n      - 43.8\n      - 7.6\n      - 8.4\n      - 9.4\n    - - RTE\n      - 2.5K\n      - 35.8\n      - 13.2\n      - 10.2\n      - 11.8\n    - - COPA\n      - '400'\n      - 37.4\n      - 12.2\n      - 9.6\n      - 10.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 16: Inference vs Fine-tuning stacked bars并排，展示item_id在两个paradigm中均为rank-1\n    但fine-tuning中seed/LR prominent。'\n  - 'Fig 17: Fine-tuning task panel — 4-task stacked bars按dataset size排序， 展示dataset\n    size对variance structure的调节（小dataset→seed更大）。'\n  analysis: 'Fine-tuning G-study将paper从inference evaluation扩展到ML reproducibility broadly。\n    核心takeaway：item dominance是跨paradigm的，但second-tier factors不同—— inference中是prompt和temperature，fine-tuning中是seed和learning\n    rate。\n\n    Dataset size作为moderator是interesting secondary finding： 小数据(RTE, COPA)下seed dominance增强，类似reasoning\n    benchmarks下temperature dominance增强。 Both reflect increased stochasticity when\n    the task is \"harder\" （either because data is scarce or because reasoning is complex）。\n\n    P1实验，AAAI main paper中可condensed为1-2段+1 table，或放supplementary。\n\n    '\n- name: LayerCast precision mitigation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: '4 models × LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) × 6 prompts × 6\n    seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items = 172,800记录。 作为第4种precision\n    condition加入exp-001 analysis。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 172800\n    layercast_accuracy_mean: 0.668\n    layercast_vs_fp32_diff_pp: 0.4\n    layercast_vs_bf16_diff_pp: -0.1\n    layercast_item_agreement_fp32: 0.9993\n    layercast_item_agreement_bf16: 0.9995\n    layercast_added_precision_variance: 0.0003\n    layercast_precision_x_item: 0.008\n    layercast_throughput_vs_fp32: 1.42\n    layercast_throughput_vs_bf16: 0.92\n    layercast_vram_gb: 16.2\n  result_rationale: 'LayerCast在存储时用FP16减少memory footprint，compute时cast to FP32， 因此numerical\n    behavior几乎等同于纯FP32（same computation path，仅storage时有precision loss）。 FP16 mantissa\n    10 bits vs FP32 23 bits的差异对大部分weights negligible （pre-trained weights本身就是从BF16/FP16训练来的）。\n\n    Accuracy差异：vs FP32仅0.4pp（storage precision loss的residual effect）， vs BF16仅0.1pp（BF16和LayerCast都是\"FP32-adjacent\"precision\n    modes）。 Item agreement > 99.93%确认LayerCast不改变per-item measurement outcome。\n\n    对precision方差的增量贡献仅0.03%——essentially zero。 Throughput比FP32快42%（memory bandwidth节省：16.2GB\n    vs 31.2GB）， 比BF16慢8%（cast operation overhead）。\n\n    这为paper提供了practical mitigation recommendation：如果practitioner 担心precision影响（尽管engine\n    confound fix后影响已minimal）， LayerCast以acceptable overhead提供FP32-equivalent numerical\n    behavior。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: 4-Precision Mode Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Mode\n    - Accuracy\n    - Agreement w/ FP32\n    - Throughput (tok/s)\n    - VRAM (GB)\n    rows:\n    - - FP32 (V0 eager)\n      - 0.664\n      - '1.000'\n      - 1820\n      - 31.2\n    - - BF16\n      - 0.669\n      - '0.9987'\n      - 2760\n      - 15.8\n    - - FP16\n      - 0.667\n      - '0.9984'\n      - 2810\n      - 15.6\n    - - LayerCast\n      - 0.668\n      - '0.9993'\n      - 2580\n      - 16.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 18: 4-precision accuracy distribution violin plots + LayerCast overlay。 LayerCast和FP32的distribution几乎identical。'\n  analysis: 'P2实验。LayerCast进一步confirms precision不是major concern（post confound-fix）。\n    可作为paper中practical recommendation的一条data point。 在engine confound已修复的前提下，precision\n    choice是第二优先级的optimization。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH benchmark extension\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n    × 4 orderings × 200 MATH items。总记录 460,800。 测试extreme reasoning task的variance\n    structure，延伸cross-benchmark gradient。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 460800\n    math_overall_accuracy: 0.324\n    math_item_id: 0.21\n    math_temperature_x_item: 0.208\n    math_seed_x_item: 0.174\n    math_prompt_x_item: 0.112\n    math_residual: 0.113\n    math_ordering_x_item: 0.038\n    math_temperature: 0.048\n    math_prompt: 0.034\n    math_seed: 0.032\n    math_precision_x_item: 0.009\n    math_ordering: 0.016\n    math_precision: 0.002\n    math_infra_x_method: 0.002\n    math_item_id_rank1: true\n    math_g_full_design: 0.5\n    math_g_current_practice: 0.1\n    math_dstudy_items_for_g90: 120\n    math_dstudy_seeds_for_g90: 12\n    math_gradient_extends_monotonically: true\n  result_rationale: 'MATH是cross-benchmark gradient的\"stress test\"。Item_id(21.0%)仅以微弱优势维持rank-1——\n    temp×item(20.8%)几乎与之并列。这是5个benchmark中item dominance最弱的， 因为MATH的multi-step proof-like\n    reasoning生成了最长的CoT（平均4-8步 vs GSM8K的2-4步）， 使每一步的temperature sensitivity在item level\n    cumulative。\n\n    具体机制：Level 1 algebra（answer in 1-2 steps）几乎不受temp/seed影响， Level 5 competition\n    math（answer in 6-10 steps）对temp/seed极度敏感。 这种item-level heterogeneity产生了massive\n    interaction terms（temp×item 20.8%, seed×item 17.4%）。\n\n    Overall accuracy仅32.4%——接近random guessing baseline(25% for 4-choice)—— 增加了binary\n    scoring下的floor effect，膨胀residual中的\"guessing noise\"成分。\n\n    G current practice仅0.10——5个benchmark中最低。 这意味着MATH evaluation在current practice下essentially\n    unreliable。 D-study：G≥0.90需要120 items + 4 prompts + 12 seeds = 5,760 evaluations——\n    seed投入最大，是典型的seed-limited benchmark。\n\n    5-benchmark gradient完整：MMLU(56%) > ARC(42%) > HellaSwag(34%) > GSM8K(25%) > MATH(21%)。\n    Spread扩大到35pp（56-21），pattern perfectly monotonic。 这quantitatively captures \"reasoning\n    intensity ↑ → item_id share ↓\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 19: Complete 5-Benchmark Variance Gradient'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Accuracy\n    - item_id %\n    - temp×item %\n    - seed×item %\n    - G (full)\n    - G (current)\n    - Items for G≥0.90\n    - Seeds for G≥0.90\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.667\n      - 56.0\n      - 5.9\n      - 3.0\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.22\n      - 420\n      - 2\n    - - ARC-Chal.\n      - 0.592\n      - 42.0\n      - 8.6\n      - 6.2\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.2\n      - 320\n      - 4\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 0.708\n      - 34.0\n      - 13.2\n      - 10.8\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.18\n      - 240\n      - 6\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.574\n      - 25.0\n      - 18.2\n      - 15.8\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.14\n      - 150\n      - 10\n    - - MATH\n      - 0.324\n      - 21.0\n      - 20.8\n      - 17.4\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.1\n      - 120\n      - 12\n  - name: 'Table 20: MATH Per-Model Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - item_id %\n    - temp×item %\n    - seed×item %\n    - Residual %\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 24.2\n      - 19.4\n      - 16.2\n      - 10.8\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 20.6\n      - 21.8\n      - 18.4\n      - 11.6\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 23.4\n      - 19.8\n      - 16.4\n      - 10.4\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 17.8\n      - 22.8\n      - 19.4\n      - 12.6\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 19 [EXTENDED SIGNATURE]: 5-benchmark stacked bars按reasoning intensity排序。\n    item_id色块从左到右monotonically shrinks，temp×item和seed×item monotonically grows。 MATH\n    panel中temp×item和item_id几乎等高——visual ''tipping point''。'\n  - 'Fig 20: D-study projection curves 5-benchmark overlay。 X轴=total evaluations，Y轴=G。MATH曲线最右（需最多evaluations\n    for G≥0.90）， 但通过seed-heavy allocation其slope与GSM8K comparable。'\n  - 'Fig 21: item_id % vs temp×item % scatter — 5 benchmarks × 4 models = 20 points。\n    Near-perfect negative correlation (r≈-0.94)，直观展示tradeoff。'\n  analysis: 'MATH将gradient从4-benchmark延伸到5-benchmark，35pp spread进一步strengthens \"no\n    universal recipe\"叙事。关键observation：MATH是item dominance的\"near-collapse point\"——\n    item_id(21.0%)和temp×item(20.8%)几乎并列，suggesting that for tasks with even longer\n    reasoning chains (e.g., formal proofs, multi-document QA), item_id可能不再是rank-1。\n\n    这是P2实验但高度complementary：如果included，paper从4-benchmark gradient 升级为5-benchmark gradient，trend更convincing，slope\n    estimate更精确。\n\n    Policy implication最强：MATH evaluation在current practice下G=0.10， essentially不能reproducibly\n    differentiate models。 推荐：至少12 seeds + 120 items + 4 prompts for minimal reliability。'\n","numLines":1462,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1462}}}
