{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T9nHfDFp6bLmHTBq22j5uH","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 4\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 18:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS — G-theory 方差分解在 LLM 评估中可行，item 方差主导（58.4%），separability 在聚合层面成立，进入\\\\n    research 阶段\\\\n  rationale: 5,400 次推理完成，5 个方差分量 ≥5% 且 CI 不含零，pipeline 端到端可运行。核心发现：(1) item 选择是评估方差最大来源；(2)\\\\n    precision/temperature/prompt 效应是 item-specific 的；(3) 直接的 infrastructure×methodology\\\\n    交互可忽略（<0.02%）。float32 引擎混淆需全研究阶段解决但不影响 MVP 结论。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 19:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采用 dual-metric (binary correct + text exact match) 方差分解作为论文核心方法论，Claim\\\\n    3 改为 metric-conditional reproducibility budget\\\\n  rationale: MVP 双变量分析揭示截然不同的方差结构：binary correct 下 item_id 主导 (58.4%, G=0.357)；text\\\\n    exact match 下 prompt×item 主导 (37.5%, G=0.975)。单一 response variable 无法完整描述评估可靠性。Dual-metric\\\\n    对比是 G-theory 框架的天然优势——\\\\\\\"同一实验在不同衡量标准下可靠性完全不同\\\\\\\"是比单一 budget 更有力的发现。precision:temperature\\\\n    交互在 text metric 下显著 (1.3%, CI 不含零)，证明 separability 在细粒度下不完全成立。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 22:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿后调整 framing：infrastructure crossing 降级为 confirmatory，cross-benchmark\\\\n    gradient 升级为 primary novelty，model-as-facet 加入分析计划\\\\n  rationale: Dream full review (dream_20260520T190053) 三档评分：Best 3/6, Median 4/6,\\\\n    Worst 3/6。三档一致暴露 9 个结构性问题：(1) bibliography 严重不足（需 25+ refs）; (2) model 未作为 G-theory\\\\n    facet（inflates item_id）; (3) 无 bootstrap CIs; (4) 零 figures; (5) infrastructure\\\\n    crossing 为 confirmatory null 非 breakthrough; (6) item dominance 心理测量学预期，oversold;\\\\n    (7) \\\\\\\"fully crossed\\\\\\\" 过度声称; (8) \\\\\\\"diagnostic tool\\\\\\\" 无实质; (9) fine-tuning 用 RoBERTa\\\\n    距离太远。全部为 framing/分析问题，不影响实验设计——P0 实验不变，但 framing 需大改，exp-004 分析内容扩展。需 re-dream\\\\n    验证后批准 P0。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: unchanged\\\\n    result: design not affected by framing changes\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: expanded\\\\n    result: added model-as-facet, bootstrap CIs, higher-order interactions, IRT comparison\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1976, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RdahfyKVtwMwAfTJrn7pUJ","session_id":"e13969ce-5d2d-4a82-903b-b87fae4e296f","uuid":"4d1b8b51-bc6c-4dae-9cdf-6c8781262e62","timestamp":"2026-05-20T23:32:08.380Z"}
