{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014hbZHvzTURT2cMo2WNDocD","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 nlp_variance_gtheory 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (2 个)\\n\\n- **bf16_eager_disentangle**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_phase_a**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-20\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **bf16_eager_disentangle** (negative): The 8.5pp accuracy gap between FP32 and BF16 in MVP Phase A is primarily due to engine differences (V0 enforce_eager vs V1 CUDA graph), not numerical precision. Running BF16+enforce_eager should show similar degradation to FP32. ← 基于 mvp_phase_a\\n- **mvp_phase_a** (success): G-theory can successfully decompose infrastructure (precision) × methodology (prompt, seed, ordering, temperature) crossed variance components in LLM evaluation, with at least 2 components exceeding 5% of total variance and at least 1 significant precision×methodology interaction.\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-32570: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019SUCnKsMZRwRnbBhjN2qc8","session_id":"e13969ce-5d2d-4a82-903b-b87fae4e296f","uuid":"342c2851-f80c-4ac0-837d-4d5698c59d5c","timestamp":"2026-05-20T23:32:39.141Z"}
